1
00:02:15,210 --> 00:02:20,119
Have you not thought about the consequences Osman?

2
00:02:34,099 --> 00:02:45,589
Visit turkision.com for more!

3
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:51,599
If anything happened to my daughter...

4
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:54,599
...then I'd have to
kill your whole family, Osman!

5
00:02:56,080 --> 00:03:01,119
They already killed my son, Yakup Bey!

6
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:08,599
Murderers!

7
00:03:12,080 --> 00:03:15,599
Blood can only be washed with blood!

8
00:03:16,080 --> 00:03:19,119
I will turn Kayi tribe into a bloodbath!

9
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:24,119
Ibrahim Bey

10
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:29,119
You are acting impulsively.

11
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:31,599
You speak impulsively.

12
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:35,599
I won't let brothers kill brothers in this tribe.

13
00:03:36,080 --> 00:03:38,119
This will end terribly.

14
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:40,599
For us...

15
00:03:41,080 --> 00:03:44,119
...there is no good ending anymore, Osman Bey!

16
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:06,599
Don't strike to kill, alps!

17
00:04:06,600 --> 00:04:08,599
There are consequences to every move!

18
00:04:08,600 --> 00:04:11,119
Come on!

19
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:17,119
Alps, take him!

20
00:04:21,079 --> 00:04:23,119
Lots of blood will be spilled, my shahzade.

21
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:25,599
May Allah save us from
spilling our brothers' blood.

22
00:04:39,080 --> 00:04:42,599
Alps! take him!

23
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:46,599
Stop!

24
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:10,599
Take them! Come on!

25
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:22,119
Alps!

26
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:52,119
Ibrahim Bey.

27
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:58,119
I understand your pain.

28
00:06:00,080 --> 00:06:02,599
What you are going through is tough.

29
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:04,719
I realise it, but...

30
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:10,119
Still, this is my last warning.

31
00:06:14,080 --> 00:06:18,599
Kill me here, Osman Bey.

32
00:06:21,080 --> 00:06:24,119
Or I am going to fall upon you
like a calamity.

33
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:35,119
Melike Hatun! Calm down!

34
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:36,599
Calm down.

35
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:39,119
Your son killed my son, Bala!

36
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:42,119
You can't find his murderer by slanders.

37
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:44,599
Alaeddin wouldn't do that.

38
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:46,119
-The one who...
-You ordered it!

39
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:47,599
You did this!

40
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:50,119
You are the murderers!

41
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:54,599
This wedding was a trap set up for us!

42
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:57,119
You lured my son into a trap!

43
00:06:57,120 --> 00:07:00,119
Watch your mouth, or I will break it!

44
00:07:00,560 --> 00:07:03,119
I understand your pain.

45
00:07:03,120 --> 00:07:06,599
But you are talking about my son here!

46
00:07:14,080 --> 00:07:16,599
Murderers!

47
00:07:18,080 --> 00:07:21,119
You'll pay for the blood you've spilled.

48
00:07:23,080 --> 00:07:25,599
You smell blood. Blood!

49
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:31,119
You can't go anywhere.

50
00:07:31,220 --> 00:07:33,119
Who are you, you dog?

51
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:35,599
What are you talking about?

52
00:07:36,080 --> 00:07:38,159
I'm saying that...

53
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:42,599
You killed Ahmet.

54
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:45,119
Did you think you you could get away?

55
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:54,119
Ahmet?

56
00:07:56,560 --> 00:07:59,119
Ahmet was alive when we left the tribe.

57
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:01,599
We didn't hurt anyone.

58
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:04,119
You're lying.

59
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:08,119
If you did something...

60
00:08:08,560 --> 00:08:11,599
...be brave and own it.

61
00:08:14,080 --> 00:08:16,599
You have Ahmet's blood on you.

62
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:19,599
We didn't kill anyone. Stand back.

63
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:21,599
Stand back?

64
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:23,599
No.

65
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:28,119
I'm here to rip off your hearts with my claws.

66
00:08:28,189 --> 00:08:30,759
Only Allah knows if you can.
We'll see.

67
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:48,599
Find a good match for you Tugay.

68
00:08:48,600 --> 00:08:50,599
You're no match for me Orhan Bey.

69
00:08:50,600 --> 00:08:53,119
Come here.

70
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:58,599
I'm the one who'll
teach you now.

71
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:03,599
Only think you'll do is die.

72
00:09:16,560 --> 00:09:18,599
Alps!

73
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:20,599
This is my tribe.

74
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:23,119
You won't spill kin blood here.

75
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:30,599
Why are you trying to stop the war...

76
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:33,599
...that you started Osman Bey?

77
00:09:33,600 --> 00:09:35,119
It's in vain.

78
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:37,599
If I had started a war...

79
00:09:39,560 --> 00:09:42,119
...you'd be defeated by now.

80
00:09:42,560 --> 00:09:44,599
You took my daughter from me.

81
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:47,119
Now you're standing against me.

82
00:09:48,080 --> 00:09:49,599
You..

83
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:52,119
..and your disgrace of a son...

84
00:09:52,280 --> 00:09:53,599
...will pay for this.

85
00:09:53,600 --> 00:09:56,119
We won't pay for anything.

86
00:09:57,080 --> 00:09:59,599
Because there is no wrong here.

87
00:10:36,080 --> 00:10:39,119
You don't have to fear for now Tugay.

88
00:10:39,560 --> 00:10:42,119
But...

89
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:44,599
...just for now.

90
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:47,119
Alps!

91
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:50,119
Take him.

92
00:10:50,560 --> 00:10:52,599
Tugay.

93
00:10:52,600 --> 00:10:55,119
You're no match for me.

94
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:57,599
And you're no match for me Orhan Bey

95
00:11:03,080 --> 00:11:05,599
You should have died long ago Cerkutay.

96
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:09,599
You think so?

97
00:11:33,560 --> 00:11:36,119
Don't try anything Mehmet Bey.

98
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:40,599
Alps!

99
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:05,599
Ibrahim Bey

100
00:12:07,080 --> 00:12:09,599
Your Alps have been stopped.

101
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:12,079
Calm down now.

102
00:12:12,120 --> 00:12:14,599
Calm down.

103
00:12:18,560 --> 00:12:20,599
There are two paths ahead of us.

104
00:12:20,600 --> 00:12:24,119
Either you'll remain calm and trust justice...

105
00:12:24,120 --> 00:12:26,599
...or...

106
00:12:27,080 --> 00:12:29,119
...you'll act rashly...

107
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:31,599
...and you will act...

108
00:12:33,560 --> 00:12:36,119
...with anger and die here.

109
00:12:40,080 --> 00:12:42,599
After you shed all that blood...

110
00:12:43,080 --> 00:12:46,599
...and acted so disrespectfully...

111
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:48,599
...which path will you...

112
00:12:48,600 --> 00:12:51,599
...choose Osman Bey?

113
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:54,119
The arrow...

114
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:57,119
...is now out of the bow now.

115
00:12:57,120 --> 00:12:59,599
The arrow will find it’s way to justice.

116
00:13:00,080 --> 00:13:03,119
Justice will be served.

117
00:13:03,560 --> 00:13:06,119
Don't worry.

118
00:13:08,080 --> 00:13:10,599
But you...

119
00:13:11,560 --> 00:13:14,599
You will act right too.

120
00:13:28,080 --> 00:13:30,119
This is my last warning to you.

121
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:32,599
The last one.

122
00:13:42,560 --> 00:13:45,119
Take them down.

123
00:13:48,560 --> 00:13:51,599
Hold on. Don't get separated.

124
00:14:18,080 --> 00:14:20,599
We're going this way, come on.

125
00:14:21,080 --> 00:14:23,599
Hold on my Shahzade.

126
00:14:24,560 --> 00:14:29,599
Didn't you say that they didn't
leave even one man standing behind?

127
00:14:30,080 --> 00:14:34,399
Find me that archer. We're
going after them come on.

128
00:14:37,560 --> 00:14:40,119
Praise be.

129
00:14:43,080 --> 00:14:44,119
Come on.

130
00:14:44,120 --> 00:14:47,119
Only Boran Bey can shoot that
fast. He's watching our backs.

131
00:14:47,120 --> 00:14:50,119
We left our horses back there.
We have to lose them, come on.

132
00:14:50,120 --> 00:14:53,119
Come on, hurry. Come on.

133
00:15:00,560 --> 00:15:03,119
They won't make it out of here alive.

134
00:15:03,120 --> 00:15:05,599
Find them for me.

135
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:09,599
This is the smell of fear.
We're going to find them by that.

136
00:15:23,080 --> 00:15:25,599
Who are you?

137
00:15:28,080 --> 00:15:30,119
You can't run now.

138
00:15:30,120 --> 00:15:33,599
Ulucay's orders. Surrender.

139
00:15:45,080 --> 00:15:47,599
Move now.

140
00:16:06,080 --> 00:16:09,119
I only take orders from my bey

141
00:16:10,560 --> 00:16:13,119
You scums.

142
00:16:28,560 --> 00:16:30,119
Let him go.

143
00:16:30,120 --> 00:16:32,599
Let him go. Don't touch him. Let go.

144
00:16:32,600 --> 00:16:35,119
Don't touch him. Move.

145
00:16:35,120 --> 00:16:39,119
Let him go.

146
00:16:40,080 --> 00:16:42,119
Don't touch him.

147
00:16:42,120 --> 00:16:44,599
Move back.

148
00:16:52,560 --> 00:16:56,119
Let him go. Move.

149
00:16:56,120 --> 00:16:59,119
No one will touch him. Move back.

150
00:17:01,080 --> 00:17:03,599
Ahmet...

151
00:17:03,600 --> 00:17:06,117
Son..

152
00:17:08,079 --> 00:17:09,598
My son.

153
00:17:09,598 --> 00:17:14,117
My son! I am here!

154
00:17:14,560 --> 00:17:18,598
I am here.

155
00:17:23,118 --> 00:17:25,598
son.

156
00:17:27,560 --> 00:17:30,119
My child.

157
00:17:46,080 --> 00:17:48,599
Even if it's not now...

158
00:17:49,080 --> 00:17:52,599
...you will pay for it eventually, Bala Hatun.

159
00:17:56,560 --> 00:17:59,599
Our children, Melike Hatun.

160
00:18:02,080 --> 00:18:04,599
I lost mine too.

161
00:18:05,080 --> 00:18:07,119
My Halime.

162
00:18:07,120 --> 00:18:10,119
I buried her before I could embrace her.

163
00:18:11,560 --> 00:18:14,119
Children

164
00:18:16,080 --> 00:18:19,599
You will lose more of your children, Bala.

165
00:18:19,600 --> 00:18:22,119
More!

166
00:18:25,080 --> 00:18:26,579
Ahmet.

167
00:18:27,600 --> 00:18:31,119
Son...
Son...

168
00:19:00,560 --> 00:19:03,119
A mistake...

169
00:19:03,560 --> 00:19:06,119
...is only forgiven once, alps!

170
00:19:07,080 --> 00:19:09,119
Keep that in mind.

171
00:19:09,120 --> 00:19:11,599
We don't want to kill you.

172
00:19:13,560 --> 00:19:16,119
Don't force us to do that.

173
00:19:24,080 --> 00:19:28,599
None of your alps died, alhamdulillah.

174
00:19:29,080 --> 00:19:31,599
And the injured ones are being treated.

175
00:19:32,080 --> 00:19:37,599
But this move did not suit you, Beys..

176
00:19:37,600 --> 00:19:42,599
We don't always do what suits us, Gunduz Bey!

177
00:19:43,560 --> 00:19:48,599
You are holding a wedding for your daughter!

178
00:19:48,600 --> 00:19:51,119
I am holding a funeral for my son!

179
00:19:58,080 --> 00:20:01,119
We brought shame to our ancestors who...

180
00:20:01,560 --> 00:20:05,599
...spilled these lands to grow them!

181
00:20:06,080 --> 00:20:10,119
If we had answered you' the same way today...

182
00:20:11,080 --> 00:20:14,119
...blood of brothers would have been spilled.

183
00:20:15,560 --> 00:20:18,119
But...

184
00:20:18,120 --> 00:20:20,119
I won't allow that.

185
00:20:20,120 --> 00:20:23,119
You say that you won't allow it...

186
00:20:23,560 --> 00:20:28,119
...but what will
you do when it's...

187
00:20:29,080 --> 00:20:32,599
....proven that it's your son Alaeddin that...

188
00:20:32,600 --> 00:20:36,119
...killed my son, are you
going to execute him or not?

189
00:20:36,120 --> 00:20:38,119
Or not!?

190
00:20:38,120 --> 00:20:42,599
Will your justice be applied to your son!?

191
00:20:46,080 --> 00:20:49,599
We are the followers of the prophet that did not...

192
00:20:50,560 --> 00:20:53,119
...stay back from punishing his daughter Fatma!

193
00:20:55,560 --> 00:20:58,599
Your doubt is an insult to us.

194
00:21:00,560 --> 00:21:02,599
We will see, Osman Bey.

195
00:21:02,600 --> 00:21:05,599
What will you see, Yakup Bey?

196
00:21:05,600 --> 00:21:09,119
He is talking about the account they will give.

197
00:21:09,120 --> 00:21:11,119
The account they will give.

198
00:21:11,120 --> 00:21:16,119
What are we going to give
you an account for, Osman Bey?

199
00:21:16,560 --> 00:21:18,119
How dare you say that!?

200
00:21:18,120 --> 00:21:20,599
Look...

201
00:21:22,080 --> 00:21:24,599
...you are in pain.

202
00:21:25,080 --> 00:21:27,119
I know that.

203
00:21:27,120 --> 00:21:29,599
That's why I am staying silent.

204
00:21:29,600 --> 00:21:33,599
But when the time comes, you will..

205
00:21:34,080 --> 00:21:36,599
...give an account for the alliance you made...

206
00:21:37,560 --> 00:21:40,599
...against us, and the market that was attacked!

207
00:21:41,560 --> 00:21:45,119
Do you have any proof to accuse us?

208
00:21:47,560 --> 00:21:51,599
You are putting the blame on us
to stand on equal grounds with us!

209
00:21:53,080 --> 00:21:55,599
I am not buying that, Osman Bey!

210
00:21:55,600 --> 00:21:58,119
What are you talking about, Yakup Beyl?

211
00:21:58,120 --> 00:22:02,119
Do you have any proof that my
son Alaeddin committed the murder?

212
00:22:02,120 --> 00:22:04,599
Show me if you have!

213
00:22:09,560 --> 00:22:12,119
No need to talk more.

214
00:22:15,120 --> 00:22:17,119
...the killer of your son...

215
00:22:17,120 --> 00:22:19,599
...is my son Alaeddin...

216
00:22:20,080 --> 00:22:22,599
...you're free to kill...

217
00:22:23,080 --> 00:22:25,599
...my son, Ibrahim Bey.

218
00:22:28,080 --> 00:22:30,119
If my son...

219
00:22:30,120 --> 00:22:32,119
..kidnapped your daughter...

220
00:22:32,120 --> 00:22:36,599
...against her will, you're free
to kill Alaeddin, Yakup Bey.

221
00:22:48,080 --> 00:22:49,599
Come on faster!

222
00:22:49,600 --> 00:22:53,119
Come on!

223
00:22:54,080 --> 00:22:55,119
We'll go there.

224
00:22:55,120 --> 00:22:58,119
Alaeddin wait. We'll use that path.

225
00:22:58,560 --> 00:22:59,759
This is our hunting area.

226
00:23:00,120 --> 00:23:03,119
We have traps for animals. They can slow them down.

227
00:23:03,560 --> 00:23:05,179
Come on! Come on!

228
00:23:22,080 --> 00:23:25,599
People with Alaeddin are witnesses.

229
00:23:26,080 --> 00:23:28,599
If they speak...

230
00:23:28,600 --> 00:23:31,119
...it will be revealed he didn't kill Ahmet.

231
00:23:32,080 --> 00:23:34,599
We'll kill them all.

232
00:23:34,600 --> 00:23:36,119
They will all die.

233
00:23:36,120 --> 00:23:38,599
Yakup Bey’s daughter too?
-She'll die.

234
00:23:40,080 --> 00:23:42,599
There can be no witnesses.

235
00:23:43,080 --> 00:23:44,599
All of them.

236
00:23:44,600 --> 00:23:46,599
Gonca...

237
00:23:46,600 --> 00:23:49,119
...and the rest.

238
00:23:50,560 --> 00:23:53,119
Alaeddin!

239
00:23:53,560 --> 00:23:56,119
You can't escape death.

240
00:23:57,080 --> 00:23:59,599
You can't escape Ulucay.

241
00:24:06,560 --> 00:24:09,119
Over here.

242
00:24:11,560 --> 00:24:13,599
I will find my son.

243
00:24:13,600 --> 00:24:17,119
There will be a court and justice will be served.

244
00:24:22,080 --> 00:24:24,599
We'll fix this in peace...

245
00:24:25,080 --> 00:24:27,599
..with no blood.

246
00:24:28,080 --> 00:24:29,599
No.

247
00:24:29,600 --> 00:24:32,599
I want blood for blood Osman Bey

248
00:24:41,120 --> 00:24:43,599
...my son Alaeddin is guilty...

249
00:24:44,560 --> 00:24:47,119
.then you'll get blood for blood...

250
00:24:50,560 --> 00:24:53,119
You can't rule the court.

251
00:24:53,560 --> 00:24:56,119
You support your son, OSman Bey.

252
00:24:57,080 --> 00:25:01,119
Your justice can't be trusted.

253
00:25:01,560 --> 00:25:05,119
How can we know that you won't protect...

254
00:25:05,560 --> 00:25:08,119
...your murderer son?

255
00:25:08,120 --> 00:25:10,599
What are you saying?

256
00:25:10,600 --> 00:25:13,119
What?

257
00:25:13,120 --> 00:25:14,599
What do you want?

258
00:25:14,600 --> 00:25:16,599
Karesi...

259
00:25:16,600 --> 00:25:19,599
...has a great Ulema...

260
00:25:20,560 --> 00:25:23,119
Judge Rukneddin will come.

261
00:25:23,560 --> 00:25:26,119
He'll rule the court..

262
00:25:30,080 --> 00:25:32,599
We side by what's right.

263
00:25:33,080 --> 00:25:35,599
Tell me Ibrahim Bey.

264
00:25:37,080 --> 00:25:39,599
Do you want this?

265
00:25:41,560 --> 00:25:43,599
This court..

266
00:25:43,600 --> 00:25:47,119
...is for Ahmet's murder.

267
00:25:48,080 --> 00:25:50,119
But..

268
00:25:50,120 --> 00:25:52,599
...if something happened to Gonca...

269
00:25:55,080 --> 00:25:57,599
..then...

270
00:25:57,600 --> 00:26:00,119
..I won't wait for court.

271
00:26:02,560 --> 00:26:04,119
-Cerkutay.
-My Bey.

272
00:26:04,120 --> 00:26:06,119
Send word to the Karesi.

273
00:26:07,560 --> 00:26:10,119
Invite Judge Rukneddin.

274
00:26:12,080 --> 00:26:14,119
He'll rule the court.

275
00:26:14,120 --> 00:26:16,119
As you wish my Bey.

276
00:26:16,120 --> 00:26:17,119
But...

277
00:26:17,290 --> 00:26:18,839
...we are true warriors.

278
00:26:19,560 --> 00:26:24,119
If you call my son a murderer
before the court takes place...

279
00:26:25,560 --> 00:26:28,119
...you're going to die.

280
00:26:28,560 --> 00:26:31,119
You won't even be able to see the court.

281
00:26:32,080 --> 00:26:36,119
Do you really trust your son this much?

282
00:26:38,560 --> 00:26:41,119
I can kill you here.

283
00:26:41,560 --> 00:26:43,599
But...

284
00:26:43,600 --> 00:26:46,599
...I know Alaeddin wouldn't hurt your son.

285
00:26:48,560 --> 00:26:51,119
I know...

286
00:26:51,560 --> 00:26:54,119
...Ahmet wouldn't hurt anyone.

287
00:26:54,720 --> 00:26:58,119
But I will hurt.

288
00:26:58,560 --> 00:27:01,119
I'll kill a lot of men Osman Bey.

289
00:27:01,560 --> 00:27:04,119
If you make a move before the court...

290
00:27:06,080 --> 00:27:09,119
...your heads will drop first.

291
00:27:17,080 --> 00:27:21,599
I swear...

292
00:27:23,560 --> 00:27:26,119
...that I'm going to kill those...

293
00:27:26,120 --> 00:27:29,119
...who did this to you.

294
00:27:29,120 --> 00:27:30,599
That Alaeddin...

295
00:27:30,600 --> 00:27:32,119
Stop there.

296
00:27:32,120 --> 00:27:34,599
Melike Hatun.

297
00:27:34,600 --> 00:27:37,119
Hold on.

298
00:27:39,560 --> 00:27:44,119
You continue your slander
without knowing the truth.

299
00:27:45,560 --> 00:27:47,119
Don't.

300
00:27:47,120 --> 00:27:49,119
The truth?

301
00:27:49,120 --> 00:27:51,119
You talk about the truth.

302
00:27:51,120 --> 00:27:52,599
Come.

303
00:27:52,600 --> 00:27:55,599
Come and see.

304
00:27:56,560 --> 00:28:00,119
The truth is here come and look.

305
00:28:01,560 --> 00:28:05,119
The truth is laying here ice cold.

306
00:28:17,560 --> 00:28:20,119
You’re a mother.

307
00:28:20,560 --> 00:28:24,119
I thought I would understand you the best.

308
00:28:30,080 --> 00:28:32,599
But you continue to nurse your grudge.

309
00:28:32,600 --> 00:28:36,119
We're going to find your son's killer despite you.

310
00:28:36,120 --> 00:28:38,119
That's when you'll feel ashamed.

311
00:28:38,120 --> 00:28:41,119
We know the killer. It's your son.

312
00:28:41,120 --> 00:28:44,119
Alaeddin. Alaeddin did this.

313
00:28:44,120 --> 00:28:46,599
He kidnapped my son's fiance.

314
00:28:46,600 --> 00:28:48,599
He disrespected his honor.

315
00:28:48,600 --> 00:28:51,599
He took my son's life, what are you talking about?

316
00:28:51,600 --> 00:28:54,599
Your anger is blinding your mind.

317
00:28:54,600 --> 00:28:57,599
Feel your pain with honor.

318
00:28:57,600 --> 00:29:00,599
Am I to learn about honor from you Bala?

319
00:29:00,600 --> 00:29:03,119
Am I to learn it from you?

320
00:29:03,120 --> 00:29:04,599
-Melike Hatun.
-Bala.

321
00:29:04,600 --> 00:29:07,119
Am I to learn it from you?

322
00:29:07,120 --> 00:29:11,119
-Let me go.
-Melike Hatun.

323
00:29:12,560 --> 00:29:13,599
Let me go.

324
00:29:13,600 --> 00:29:17,599
Come to your senses Melike
Hatun. What are you doing?

325
00:29:17,600 --> 00:29:18,599
Let me go.

326
00:29:18,600 --> 00:29:21,599
Don't test me. I'm at my limit.

327
00:29:21,600 --> 00:29:23,599
Bala, this is nothing.

328
00:29:23,600 --> 00:29:27,599
I'm going to end your bloodline Bala.

329
00:29:27,600 --> 00:29:29,599
Just wait Bala.

330
00:29:29,600 --> 00:29:32,599
You're going to meet Melike Hatun now.

331
00:29:32,600 --> 00:29:33,599
Bala.

332
00:29:33,600 --> 00:29:36,599
Look here, I'm forgiving you this time.

333
00:29:36,600 --> 00:29:41,119
But if you repeat it even your
pain won't be enough to save you.

334
00:29:41,120 --> 00:29:42,599
Elcim.

335
00:29:42,600 --> 00:29:45,599
Girl, when she says goodbye to her son....

336
00:29:45,600 --> 00:29:47,119
...let the Baciyans keep watch.

337
00:29:47,120 --> 00:29:48,599
-Okay Bala Hatun.
-Let me go.

338
00:29:48,600 --> 00:29:51,119
We will do as you say.

339
00:29:52,650 --> 00:29:53,989
Get out!

340
00:30:18,080 --> 00:30:20,119
We chose the wrong thing Gonca.

341
00:30:20,120 --> 00:30:22,119
We should've taken the other way around.

342
00:30:22,120 --> 00:30:23,559
Alaeddin.

343
00:30:23,600 --> 00:30:28,599
This is our hunting grounds.
There are traps everywhere.

344
00:30:28,600 --> 00:30:31,119
Look.

345
00:30:41,080 --> 00:30:43,599
So you say we're going to
draw them to the traps huh?

346
00:30:43,600 --> 00:30:45,999
That's right.

347
00:30:47,560 --> 00:30:50,599
They're coming closer. Step where I step.

348
00:30:50,600 --> 00:30:53,119
-Come on.
-Come on.

349
00:30:55,560 --> 00:30:58,119
Be careful.

350
00:31:09,560 --> 00:31:12,119
They're changing directions.

351
00:31:12,120 --> 00:31:15,119
They're going deeper into the forest.

352
00:31:15,120 --> 00:31:19,119
But they still have the. smell of fear on them.

353
00:31:19,560 --> 00:31:22,119
I'm going to find them by it.

354
00:31:22,560 --> 00:31:25,119
Come on.

355
00:31:26,080 --> 00:31:28,599
Stop.

356
00:31:40,560 --> 00:31:43,119
They're there. Come on.

357
00:31:44,560 --> 00:31:47,119
Stop

358
00:32:03,080 --> 00:32:04,599
I said stop.

359
00:32:04,600 --> 00:32:07,119
Stop.

360
00:32:11,560 --> 00:32:14,119
My shahzade.

361
00:32:14,120 --> 00:32:17,599
My shahzade!
The traps worked.

362
00:32:17,600 --> 00:32:19,599
It will keep them busy.

363
00:32:19,600 --> 00:32:22,119
Thank Allah, good.

364
00:32:23,560 --> 00:32:26,599
But it won't stop them. We need to run.

365
00:32:27,080 --> 00:32:29,599
Come on.

366
00:32:36,080 --> 00:32:38,599
Goodness gracious!

367
00:32:39,080 --> 00:32:41,599
They are like rabid dogs!

368
00:32:43,080 --> 00:32:45,599
It's just a scratch, it's okay.

369
00:32:45,600 --> 00:32:48,119
Come on.

370
00:32:49,560 --> 00:32:52,119
Keep your eyes on her.

371
00:32:52,120 --> 00:32:54,079
Melike Hatun will not stay put.

372
00:32:54,120 --> 00:32:57,599
Her disrespect shouldn't go unpunished, Bala Hatun.

373
00:32:57,600 --> 00:33:00,599
It won't, my father will punish
her when he hears about it.

374
00:33:00,600 --> 00:33:02,599
No, my girl.

375
00:33:02,600 --> 00:33:04,599
Your father will not know.

376
00:33:04,600 --> 00:33:07,599
Things are in a chaos, he
will get angrier. Don't tell him.

377
00:33:08,080 --> 00:33:09,599
Do you want her to get away with it?

378
00:33:09,600 --> 00:33:13,119
She tried to hurt you, she spilled your blood.

379
00:33:13,560 --> 00:33:16,119
Don't worry Bala Hatun.

380
00:33:16,120 --> 00:33:17,599
We won't tell anything to anyone.

381
00:33:17,600 --> 00:33:20,119
But...

382
00:33:20,120 --> 00:33:22,119
...Alaeddin Bey...

383
00:33:22,120 --> 00:33:24,119
...how is he going to clean his name?

384
00:33:24,120 --> 00:33:26,599
My shahzade wouldn't do anything like that.

385
00:33:26,600 --> 00:33:29,119
He wouldn't, but...

386
00:33:29,120 --> 00:33:31,599
...what if he had to kill Ahmet Bey?

387
00:33:32,080 --> 00:33:34,119
That's what I am scared of.

388
00:33:34,120 --> 00:33:36,119
What if he was trying to protect himself?

389
00:33:36,120 --> 00:33:37,119
Or Gonca?

390
00:33:37,120 --> 00:33:40,599
We will learn when we find Alaeddin.

391
00:33:42,560 --> 00:33:44,119
It's not as we think.

392
00:33:44,120 --> 00:33:46,119
Mother, mother.

393
00:33:46,120 --> 00:33:48,599
What if my brother is guilty?

394
00:33:48,600 --> 00:33:50,599
Mother, what will happen to my brother?

395
00:33:50,600 --> 00:33:53,119
Ibrahim Bey wants to kill him.

396
00:33:53,560 --> 00:33:56,599
That means war.

397
00:33:56,600 --> 00:33:59,119
May Allah protect.

398
00:34:00,080 --> 00:34:02,599
Brothers would kill each other!

399
00:34:03,080 --> 00:34:05,599
No my girl. Don't be afraid.

400
00:34:05,600 --> 00:34:07,599
Don't be afraid.

401
00:34:07,600 --> 00:34:10,119
Your father wouldn't let a war...

402
00:34:10,120 --> 00:34:13,119
...to break out, or brothers to kill each other.

403
00:34:13,560 --> 00:34:14,599
Don't be afraid.

404
00:34:14,600 --> 00:34:17,119
I hope so.

405
00:34:22,080 --> 00:34:25,599
They martyred my brave son treacherously!

406
00:34:26,560 --> 00:34:30,599
I can't wait for their justice, Yakup Bey!

407
00:34:30,600 --> 00:34:33,599
We won't wait, Ibrahim Bey.

408
00:34:35,080 --> 00:34:37,599
Before Osman destroys the evidence...

409
00:34:37,600 --> 00:34:40,119
..we will get him!

410
00:34:44,560 --> 00:34:46,119
My Bey.

411
00:34:46,120 --> 00:34:48,599
The wounded alps are treated.

412
00:34:48,600 --> 00:34:51,119
The remaining alps are taken to the caged tent.

413
00:34:54,560 --> 00:34:56,599
Osman...

414
00:34:56,600 --> 00:35:01,599
He hides behind the lies of
justice, and wants to save his son.

415
00:35:02,560 --> 00:35:05,119
But he won't do it.

416
00:35:06,560 --> 00:35:10,119
He thinks he has the upper hand.

417
00:35:10,560 --> 00:35:12,599
He imprisoned the alps.

418
00:35:12,600 --> 00:35:15,119
He keeps us under watch.

419
00:35:20,560 --> 00:35:24,599
But we will strike him...

420
00:35:29,560 --> 00:35:32,119
Alps are watching us.

421
00:35:33,080 --> 00:35:35,599
Let's go to the tent.

422
00:35:42,080 --> 00:35:45,599
We all know Shahzade Alaeddin.

423
00:35:45,600 --> 00:35:48,119
He wouldn't do something like that.

424
00:35:48,560 --> 00:35:51,119
There is something else going on.

425
00:35:52,080 --> 00:35:55,119
My Bey, forgive me but...

426
00:35:55,560 --> 00:35:59,599
...a man has only one weakness, his heart.

427
00:36:00,080 --> 00:36:03,119
What if Ahmet Bey crossed the line?

428
00:36:03,560 --> 00:36:05,119
Said something bad?

429
00:36:05,120 --> 00:36:07,599
Is that what my son learned from me?

430
00:36:08,560 --> 00:36:10,599
You all know well:

431
00:36:10,600 --> 00:36:13,599
No, my son wouldn't do that.

432
00:36:14,080 --> 00:36:18,599
We have fought many of our own
kin. We haven't killed any before.

433
00:36:20,560 --> 00:36:23,119
My sons are educated with the virtues of the state.

434
00:36:23,560 --> 00:36:27,599
They wouldn't do anything without
thinking of the consequences.

435
00:36:28,560 --> 00:36:32,599
It's not about heroism. It's about the state.

436
00:36:33,560 --> 00:36:36,599
you know who brought the trouble...

437
00:36:36,600 --> 00:36:40,119
...then you should look at
who benefits from it. Tell me...

438
00:36:40,560 --> 00:36:43,599
...who would benefit from
Turks fighting each other?

439
00:36:44,080 --> 00:36:45,119
The crusaders my Bey.

440
00:36:45,120 --> 00:36:46,119
Mongolians.

441
00:36:46,120 --> 00:36:50,599
Yes. We'll reveal those who wish to trick us.

442
00:36:50,600 --> 00:36:53,119
But the real issue...

443
00:36:53,120 --> 00:36:55,599
...is the liar among us.

444
00:36:58,080 --> 00:37:00,599
Ibrahim Bey.

445
00:37:01,080 --> 00:37:03,599
He won't stop hurting us.

446
00:37:03,600 --> 00:37:06,119
Yakup Bey's looking for a way to end us.

447
00:37:08,560 --> 00:37:11,119
But we won't allow tricks.

448
00:37:11,560 --> 00:37:15,599
We'll reveal the liars without
spilling brother's blood.

449
00:37:19,560 --> 00:37:21,599
When I get my son's corpse...

450
00:37:21,600 --> 00:37:24,119
right in front of me...

451
00:37:24,560 --> 00:37:27,119
...I want Alaeddin's dead body too.

452
00:37:30,080 --> 00:37:32,599
War will come of this.

453
00:37:35,560 --> 00:37:38,119
The borders will be a hell hole.

454
00:37:38,560 --> 00:37:41,119
Yakup Bey.

455
00:37:41,560 --> 00:37:43,599
Eventually...

456
00:37:43,600 --> 00:37:46,119
...this was going to happen.

457
00:37:52,080 --> 00:37:54,599
Mehmet.

458
00:37:54,600 --> 00:37:57,119
You'll kill Alaeddin.

459
00:38:02,080 --> 00:38:04,599
Gonca?

460
00:38:11,600 --> 00:38:14,599
...don't have a daughter named Gonca.

461
00:38:21,080 --> 00:38:23,599
You know what to do.

462
00:38:31,560 --> 00:38:34,599
When war breaks out...

463
00:38:35,080 --> 00:38:36,599
...we'll be at the fore front.

464
00:38:36,600 --> 00:38:38,599
You want to spill brother's blood.

465
00:38:38,600 --> 00:38:41,119
What needs to happen will happen Tugay.

466
00:38:45,080 --> 00:38:47,119
Tomorrow...

467
00:38:47,120 --> 00:38:49,599
...Ahmet's funeral will be held.

468
00:38:50,080 --> 00:38:52,599
It is a good day to fight...

469
00:38:52,600 --> 00:38:55,119
...after a long time of quiet.

470
00:38:57,080 --> 00:38:59,599
What's on your mind my Bey?

471
00:39:02,080 --> 00:39:04,599
Yes.

472
00:39:04,600 --> 00:39:07,119
Ulcay and Alps...

473
00:39:07,120 --> 00:39:09,599
...will go to the cemetery...

474
00:39:09,600 --> 00:39:12,119
..and save us from the cages.

475
00:39:14,560 --> 00:39:16,599
Now...

476
00:39:16,600 --> 00:39:19,119
Listen carefully.

477
00:39:22,560 --> 00:39:25,599
Since Sultan Mesut died...

478
00:39:25,600 --> 00:39:28,599
...we stopped war at all times.

479
00:39:29,080 --> 00:39:31,599
We always made an effort for it.

480
00:39:31,600 --> 00:39:34,119
We can't back down anymore.

481
00:39:34,560 --> 00:39:36,599
So we'll fight.

482
00:39:36,600 --> 00:39:38,119
We didn't start it.

483
00:39:38,120 --> 00:39:40,599
But we'll see it end, if Allah permits.

484
00:39:40,600 --> 00:39:43,119
If Allah permits. my Bey.

485
00:39:48,560 --> 00:39:50,119
Gunduz Bey.

486
00:39:50,120 --> 00:39:52,119
Send Alps to north of Candaroglus.

487
00:39:52,120 --> 00:39:55,599
Will Alps shoot their arrows?

488
00:39:55,600 --> 00:39:58,119
They shoot their arrows and swing their swords.

489
00:39:58,120 --> 00:40:00,119
It is too late now.

490
00:40:00,120 --> 00:40:03,119
Now tell your Alps the news.

491
00:40:03,120 --> 00:40:05,119
As you wish.

492
00:40:05,120 --> 00:40:07,119
It is your order Osman Bey.

493
00:40:07,120 --> 00:40:09,119
The tribe..

494
00:40:09,120 --> 00:40:12,119
...belongs to you and Solgur Aga.

495
00:40:12,120 --> 00:40:14,119
As you wish my Bey.

496
00:40:14,120 --> 00:40:16,119
Thank you.

497
00:40:16,120 --> 00:40:20,119
Come on. We know where
Alaeddin and Gonca will meet.

498
00:40:20,120 --> 00:40:23,119
Let's go to Alaeddin and find out the truth.

499
00:40:23,120 --> 00:40:25,599
Come on. Come on Alps.

500
00:40:38,560 --> 00:40:41,119
Here, my Shehzade.

501
00:40:44,080 --> 00:40:46,599
The tribe's crowded.
We can't escape.

502
00:40:47,560 --> 00:40:49,459
We'll use the training area.

503
00:40:49,470 --> 00:40:50,210
Come.

504
00:40:50,210 --> 00:40:53,119
As you wish my Shehzade.

505
00:40:56,560 --> 00:40:59,119
Come on brave boys.

506
00:40:59,120 --> 00:41:01,599
Show me how you use a sword.

507
00:41:04,080 --> 00:41:06,599
Come on.

508
00:41:16,560 --> 00:41:20,119
Praise be, praise be to our brave men.

509
00:41:29,080 --> 00:41:31,599
We're close to the horses.

510
00:41:33,080 --> 00:41:34,599
Come on.

511
00:41:34,600 --> 00:41:37,119
Come on, with the name of Allah, Shahzade.

512
00:41:42,560 --> 00:41:46,599
You showed us your master of sword fighting.

513
00:41:46,600 --> 00:41:49,119
Let us see how good you
are with the bow too, come on..

514
00:41:49,120 --> 00:41:51,119
Come on, get your bows.

515
00:41:51,120 --> 00:41:51,599
Come on.

516
00:41:51,600 --> 00:41:54,119
Fatma Hatun.

517
00:41:55,080 --> 00:41:57,119
What if they get caught?

518
00:41:57,120 --> 00:41:59,599
What if Gonca Hatun and the Tall Shahzade die?

519
00:41:59,600 --> 00:42:00,559
Ghazi.

520
00:42:00,600 --> 00:42:02,119
Say good things.

521
00:42:02,120 --> 00:42:04,599
That won't happen.

522
00:42:05,080 --> 00:42:08,599
My brother can take care of himself.

523
00:42:10,560 --> 00:42:12,119
Watch it.

524
00:42:12,120 --> 00:42:14,599
Don't worry about these.

525
00:42:14,600 --> 00:42:17,599
Practice well, there is a fight in the horizon.

526
00:42:23,080 --> 00:42:24,599
Stop.

527
00:42:24,600 --> 00:42:27,119
What are you doing here?

528
00:42:27,560 --> 00:42:30,119
Hold on.

529
00:42:39,560 --> 00:42:42,119
We're getting our freedom.

530
00:42:50,560 --> 00:42:53,119
Ghazi go and tell the alps,
someone is running away.

531
00:42:53,120 --> 00:42:55,599
Okay.

532
00:42:57,560 --> 00:42:59,599
Stop.

533
00:42:59,600 --> 00:43:02,119
Where are you running off to?

534
00:43:05,560 --> 00:43:06,599
Let me go.

535
00:43:06,600 --> 00:43:08,119
Let go.

536
00:43:08,120 --> 00:43:11,599
You're at the wrong place at
the wrong time, Fatma Hatun.

537
00:43:11,600 --> 00:43:13,599
You won’t make it out of the tribe.

538
00:43:13,600 --> 00:43:16,119
Fatma Hatun.

539
00:43:17,080 --> 00:43:18,599
What are you doing?

540
00:43:18,600 --> 00:43:22,119
Don't get close or I'll kill Fatma
Hatun without blinking an eye.

541
00:43:22,120 --> 00:43:24,119
Make way.

542
00:43:24,120 --> 00:43:27,119
Or I'll make it with Fatma Hatun's blood.

543
00:43:30,080 --> 00:43:32,599
Come on.

544
00:43:33,080 --> 00:43:35,599
Make way.

545
00:43:36,080 --> 00:43:38,119
Come on.

546
00:43:38,120 --> 00:43:42,119
Who is going to save you once
Osman Bey hears about it, Mehmet Bey?

547
00:43:42,120 --> 00:43:47,599
Even Osman Bey won't be able to save
you when Germiyan's army comes for you.

548
00:43:49,560 --> 00:43:52,119
Come on.

549
00:44:02,560 --> 00:44:04,119
Fitnat.

550
00:44:04,120 --> 00:44:08,119
Once we're out of the tribe give them Fatma Hatun.

551
00:44:08,560 --> 00:44:11,119
Come on.

552
00:44:14,080 --> 00:44:15,599
Alps.

553
00:44:15,600 --> 00:44:18,119
Follow them.

554
00:44:22,080 --> 00:44:24,599
You snake.

555
00:44:34,560 --> 00:44:36,599
What will we do now Shahzade?

556
00:44:36,600 --> 00:44:40,599
First we're going to go to the market
and figure out where that Alaeddin went.

557
00:44:40,600 --> 00:44:42,599
I'm going to...

558
00:44:42,600 --> 00:44:45,599
...kill him and his lover with my bare hands.

559
00:44:51,080 --> 00:44:53,599
Come on.

560
00:44:56,080 --> 00:44:58,599
But first, we're going to lose Osman's dogs.

561
00:44:58,600 --> 00:45:01,119
Come on.

562
00:45:03,560 --> 00:45:07,119
We're going to go into the
forest and lose them Kanyumaz.

563
00:45:07,560 --> 00:45:08,599
Come on.

564
00:45:08,600 --> 00:45:11,119
As you wish my Shahzade.

565
00:45:14,080 --> 00:45:16,599
Let me go.

566
00:45:16,600 --> 00:45:19,119
Let go.

567
00:45:20,080 --> 00:45:23,599
Put her in the tent with the cage. Take her away.

568
00:45:24,560 --> 00:45:26,599
Let go.

569
00:45:26,600 --> 00:45:30,599
Wait! I am going to make you pay!

570
00:45:30,600 --> 00:45:32,599
Move!

571
00:45:32,800 --> 00:45:34,599
Let go of me!

572
00:45:34,600 --> 00:45:37,599
Inform Osman Bey that Mehmet escaped.

573
00:45:39,560 --> 00:45:41,599
They wanted to...

574
00:45:41,600 --> 00:45:44,599
...take justice in their own hands.

575
00:45:44,600 --> 00:45:47,977
I hope they will be stopped
before anything happens.

576
00:45:47,989 --> 00:45:49,119
I hope so.

577
00:45:52,560 --> 00:45:56,119
We wanted this to > be resolved in a trial...

578
00:45:56,120 --> 00:45:58,599
..but you schemed behind our backs!

579
00:45:59,080 --> 00:46:01,599
I don't trust you!

580
00:46:01,600 --> 00:46:04,599
We don't trust you either!

581
00:46:04,600 --> 00:46:07,119
That's why we did it, Gunduz Bey!

582
00:46:07,560 --> 00:46:12,119
If Mehmet does anything on his own...

583
00:46:12,120 --> 00:46:14,599
...apart from your deal with Osman Bey...

584
00:46:15,080 --> 00:46:17,599
...you will all pay for this!

585
00:46:19,080 --> 00:46:23,599
We paid the price!

586
00:46:24,560 --> 00:46:27,119
Take them!

587
00:46:35,080 --> 00:46:38,119
Keep your eyes on them!

588
00:46:38,560 --> 00:46:41,119
I don't want another mistake, Aykurt.

589
00:46:41,560 --> 00:46:44,119
Okay my Bey.

590
00:47:17,080 --> 00:47:18,599
What happened?

591
00:47:18,600 --> 00:47:21,599
Mehmet Bey escaped, my Bey

592
00:47:22,080 --> 00:47:24,599
What?

593
00:47:26,560 --> 00:47:28,599
How could he?

594
00:47:28,600 --> 00:47:31,599
He used Fatma Hatun and Gazi; and escaped.

595
00:47:32,080 --> 00:47:33,119
Are they okay?

596
00:47:33,120 --> 00:47:34,119
They are okay, thank Allah.

597
00:47:34,120 --> 00:47:36,599
Oh Allah.

598
00:47:37,560 --> 00:47:39,599
They used the children to escape, huh?

599
00:47:39,600 --> 00:47:41,599
What were you doing?

600
00:47:41,600 --> 00:47:44,119
How am I going to trust you
and leave things to your hands?

601
00:47:46,560 --> 00:47:48,599
It won't happen again, my Bey.

602
00:47:48,600 --> 00:47:51,119
If it happens...

603
00:47:51,120 --> 00:47:53,599
...you know what your punishment will be.

604
00:47:57,080 --> 00:47:59,119
I knew they wouldn't stay put.

605
00:47:59,120 --> 00:48:00,119
What will we do now Osman?

606
00:48:00,120 --> 00:48:02,599
Mehmet is going to go after Alaeddin.

607
00:48:02,600 --> 00:48:04,119
We won’t stop either.

608
00:48:04,120 --> 00:48:06,119
-Orhan.
-My Bey..

609
00:48:06,120 --> 00:48:07,599
Go after Alaeddin.

610
00:48:07,600 --> 00:48:09,119
You know where he is.

611
00:48:09,120 --> 00:48:12,599
I will return with my brother,
or don't return at all, my Bey.

612
00:48:12,600 --> 00:48:14,119
Don't worry.

613
00:48:14,120 --> 00:48:16,599
We will go to the frontier market.

614
00:48:16,600 --> 00:48:18,559
Let's learn what happened.

615
00:48:18,600 --> 00:48:21,119
That's the only way to stop the war.

616
00:48:23,080 --> 00:48:25,119
Hasan.

617
00:48:25,120 --> 00:48:28,119
Now, go to Gunduz Bey.

618
00:48:28,560 --> 00:48:30,599
Tell him...

619
00:48:30,600 --> 00:48:35,599
...to keep his eyes on Ibrahim and Yakup Beys.

620
00:48:36,080 --> 00:48:38,599
As you command my Bey.

621
00:48:39,560 --> 00:48:42,119
Come on!

622
00:48:47,080 --> 00:48:49,599
Caravansary.

623
00:49:09,080 --> 00:49:13,599
What happened? You lost
your mind after getting punched?

624
00:49:16,560 --> 00:49:20,599
Anything can happen to you in life.

625
00:49:20,600 --> 00:49:23,119
Now you are my prisoner.

626
00:49:23,120 --> 00:49:25,599
Well, those who look themselves in a...

627
00:49:25,600 --> 00:49:29,119
giant's mirror will keep falling down.

628
00:49:34,560 --> 00:49:37,599
What did you do with Konur? Has he not come at all?

629
00:49:37,600 --> 00:49:39,599
He came.

630
00:49:39,600 --> 00:49:42,599
I took care of him, and listened to his intentions.

631
00:49:44,080 --> 00:49:46,119
His path is ghaza path...

632
00:49:46,120 --> 00:49:48,599
...and his cause is the cause of the Haqq.

633
00:49:48,600 --> 00:49:51,119
I am sure of it now.

634
00:49:53,080 --> 00:49:55,599
Konur is my brother again

635
00:49:56,080 --> 00:49:58,599
And our paths are the same..

636
00:49:59,080 --> 00:50:01,599
You realized it now, huh?

637
00:50:03,080 --> 00:50:05,599
Then tell me, where is Konur?

638
00:50:06,080 --> 00:50:07,599
He went to Ibrahim Bey..

639
00:50:07,600 --> 00:50:10,119
He will accept his offer then.

640
00:50:10,560 --> 00:50:12,599
I don't know.

641
00:50:12,600 --> 00:50:15,119
But shahzade Alaeddin..

642
00:50:16,080 --> 00:50:20,599
...people say that he killed shahzade
Ahmet while kidnapping Gonca Hatun.

643
00:50:21,080 --> 00:50:23,599
I don't believe it.

644
00:50:23,600 --> 00:50:26,119
But everyone keeps speaking of this.

645
00:50:26,560 --> 00:50:29,119
This means war Boran.

646
00:50:32,560 --> 00:50:35,119
Oh no.

647
00:50:35,560 --> 00:50:38,119
What did Ibrahim Bey do?

648
00:50:38,120 --> 00:50:40,599
He was at my Bey's tribe.

649
00:50:40,600 --> 00:50:43,119
I don't know the rest.

650
00:50:43,560 --> 00:50:46,599
Konur went to Ibrahim Bey for this.

651
00:50:47,560 --> 00:50:50,119
Konur owes Ibrahim Bey his life.

652
00:50:50,560 --> 00:50:53,599
He'll pay his price and go on his own way.

653
00:50:54,080 --> 00:50:56,599
Since we walk the same path...

654
00:50:56,600 --> 00:51:00,119
...untie me and let's get to our business.

655
00:51:00,560 --> 00:51:03,119
Okay.

656
00:51:07,800 --> 00:51:10,799
Germiyanoglu Border - Frontier Market

657
00:51:20,080 --> 00:51:22,599
Can't I rely on you, huh?

658
00:51:22,600 --> 00:51:25,119
My sister was abducted!

659
00:51:27,080 --> 00:51:30,039
And you didn't even hear a thing.

660
00:51:30,120 --> 00:51:33,599
When this is done you'll be punished.

661
00:51:34,560 --> 00:51:37,119
Stand back.

662
00:51:37,560 --> 00:51:38,119
Kayyumaz.

663
00:51:38,120 --> 00:51:40,599
-My Shehzade?
-Make them work at the hardest areas.

664
00:51:40,600 --> 00:51:41,759
I want them dead tired.

665
00:51:41,759 --> 00:51:43,119
As you wish Shehzade.

666
00:51:43,120 --> 00:51:44,599
Any trace, Kayyumaz?

667
00:51:44,600 --> 00:51:47,599
My Bey. Someone helped them get in.

668
00:51:47,600 --> 00:51:49,119
We suspect Gulce Hatun.

669
00:51:49,120 --> 00:51:50,599
People saw her.

670
00:51:50,600 --> 00:51:52,599
Idiot!

671
00:51:52,600 --> 00:51:55,599
Don't pity her when you find her.

672
00:51:56,560 --> 00:51:59,119
Send a messenger to Kutahya and Kastamonu.

673
00:51:59,120 --> 00:52:00,599
War has begun.

674
00:52:00,600 --> 00:52:03,599
Send Alps to borders. Kayi
will be erased from earth.

675
00:52:03,600 --> 00:52:04,780
As you wish my Shehzade.

676
00:52:04,780 --> 00:52:06,119
Adra.
-Yes?

677
00:52:06,120 --> 00:52:08,119
Go to Mekece Castle.

678
00:52:08,120 --> 00:52:10,599
We'll give them a chance to take revenge on Osman.

679
00:52:11,080 --> 00:52:13,119
Tell them what happened.

680
00:52:13,120 --> 00:52:15,599
They'll ready their soldiers.

681
00:52:15,600 --> 00:52:18,119
We'll need their support for the war.

682
00:52:18,120 --> 00:52:21,599
I’ll do my best to involve them in the war.

683
00:52:22,080 --> 00:52:24,599
Before Osman I'll find Alaeddin and Gonca.

684
00:52:36,560 --> 00:52:38,599
They're still after us.

685
00:52:38,600 --> 00:52:41,119
We couldn't escape.

686
00:52:42,080 --> 00:52:44,599
If we could erase our track.

687
00:52:47,080 --> 00:52:49,599
I'll find a way.

688
00:52:50,560 --> 00:52:52,599
You'll go through there...

689
00:52:52,600 --> 00:52:54,119
and I...
Alaeddin.

690
00:52:54,120 --> 00:52:56,599
What do you mean?

691
00:52:56,600 --> 00:52:59,119
We'll leave together.

692
00:53:00,080 --> 00:53:01,119
No.

693
00:53:01,120 --> 00:53:03,119
We can't escape together Gonca.

694
00:53:03,120 --> 00:53:05,599
They'll find our tracks.

695
00:53:06,080 --> 00:53:08,119
I'll make them follow me.

696
00:53:08,120 --> 00:53:10,599
And you'll go to the cave.

697
00:53:10,600 --> 00:53:12,599
I won't leave your side.

698
00:53:12,600 --> 00:53:15,119
We'll go together.

699
00:53:15,120 --> 00:53:16,599
Sweetheart.

700
00:53:16,600 --> 00:53:18,599
Even if there's death?

701
00:53:18,600 --> 00:53:20,599
No.

702
00:53:21,080 --> 00:53:23,119
I won't lead you to death Gonca.

703
00:53:23,120 --> 00:53:24,079
Know it.

704
00:53:24,120 --> 00:53:26,599
Even if there's death Alaeddin.

705
00:53:28,080 --> 00:53:29,559
But..

706
00:53:29,600 --> 00:53:32,119
...if you insist...

707
00:53:32,560 --> 00:53:35,119
...then find a way to live.

708
00:53:38,560 --> 00:53:40,599
They want to poison our love...

709
00:53:40,600 --> 00:53:43,119
...with tricks and evil plans.

710
00:53:43,560 --> 00:53:45,559
Do you regret it Gonca?

711
00:53:45,600 --> 00:53:48,119
We're together.

712
00:53:48,560 --> 00:53:51,119
I have no regrets.

713
00:53:52,560 --> 00:53:55,119
We'll get to the end together.

714
00:53:58,080 --> 00:54:00,599
If it’s together...

715
00:54:00,600 --> 00:54:03,119
...even death sounds nice Alaeddin.

716
00:54:04,560 --> 00:54:07,119
Praise be!

717
00:54:08,080 --> 00:54:10,599
You'll kill the enemies right Gonca?

718
00:54:13,560 --> 00:54:16,119
Shehzade.

719
00:54:17,560 --> 00:54:20,119
They found us. They're coming closer.

720
00:54:23,560 --> 00:54:26,119
Come on Gonca. Come on.

721
00:54:26,120 --> 00:54:28,599
Come on.

722
00:54:47,080 --> 00:54:49,599
Come here.

723
00:55:11,560 --> 00:55:13,119
Holofira.

724
00:55:13,120 --> 00:55:14,599
You should go to the tribe.

725
00:55:14,600 --> 00:55:16,119
No.

726
00:55:16,120 --> 00:55:18,599
No, don't ask that from me

727
00:55:19,080 --> 00:55:20,599
I won't leave you.

728
00:55:20,600 --> 00:55:23,119
If my father knows he must have be on his way.

729
00:55:23,120 --> 00:55:26,119
You might come across him
on your way, you can get us help.

730
00:55:26,120 --> 00:55:28,119
Go now.

731
00:55:28,120 --> 00:55:30,599
Holofira you did everything you could.

732
00:55:30,600 --> 00:55:35,599
But we don't know what awaits, we can't
put your life in danger anymore. Go now.

733
00:55:38,690 --> 00:55:40,289
Let Gulce go.

734
00:55:45,560 --> 00:55:48,599
Holofira, we don't have time.

735
00:55:49,560 --> 00:55:51,119
Go now.

736
00:55:51,120 --> 00:55:53,599
Holofira Hatun.

737
00:55:53,600 --> 00:55:56,119
Go.

738
00:55:57,560 --> 00:56:00,119
Okay.

739
00:56:01,560 --> 00:56:05,599
I promise you, I'm going to bring you that help.

740
00:56:15,560 --> 00:56:18,119
May Allah help you on your way.

741
00:56:20,080 --> 00:56:21,119
Come on.

742
00:56:21,560 --> 00:56:24,119
Come on.

743
00:56:24,560 --> 00:56:28,119
Come on Gonca, Baysungur, Gulce. We're leaving.

744
00:56:32,560 --> 00:56:35,119
Come on.

745
00:56:37,080 --> 00:56:40,599
Stand back Osman Bey, what are you doing here?

746
00:56:46,560 --> 00:56:48,599
I won't warn you again Osman Bey.

747
00:56:48,600 --> 00:56:51,119
Brothers.

748
00:56:51,560 --> 00:56:54,599
Alps don't take mercy.

749
00:56:55,080 --> 00:56:57,599
Brothers what are you doing?

750
00:56:59,560 --> 00:57:02,119
My bey.

751
00:57:06,080 --> 00:57:08,599
Brothers, it's me.

752
00:57:09,080 --> 00:57:10,599
Cerkutay.

753
00:57:10,600 --> 00:57:13,119
The Cerkutay who you shared your...

754
00:57:13,120 --> 00:57:15,599
...food with, who you defeated the same enemy with.

755
00:57:15,600 --> 00:57:19,599
Brother hear me out, did I ever lie to you?

756
00:57:20,080 --> 00:57:22,559
No I wouldn't.

757
00:57:22,600 --> 00:57:25,599
There is unrest among us.

758
00:57:25,600 --> 00:57:29,119
It made us become enemies to each other.

759
00:57:30,560 --> 00:57:32,119
Listen.

760
00:57:32,120 --> 00:57:37,119
Listen to me, this is the
work of a two headed snake.

761
00:57:40,080 --> 00:57:44,119
Osman Bey...

762
00:57:45,560 --> 00:57:48,599
...is here to reveal this trap.

763
00:57:48,600 --> 00:57:51,119
Brothers.

764
00:57:51,120 --> 00:57:53,599
Lower your weapons.

765
00:57:53,600 --> 00:57:56,599
Everything you heard were lies, alps.

766
00:57:56,600 --> 00:57:58,599
Our son Alaeddin...

767
00:57:58,600 --> 00:58:01,119
...didn't kill Shahzade Ahmet.

768
00:58:01,120 --> 00:58:04,599
This truth will be revealed sooner or later.

769
00:58:04,600 --> 00:58:07,119
Come on.

770
00:58:07,120 --> 00:58:09,599
Make way, alps.

771
00:58:09,600 --> 00:58:11,599
Make way so that..

772
00:58:11,600 --> 00:58:14,119
...you live a long life.

773
00:58:53,560 --> 00:58:55,559
Alps.

774
00:58:55,600 --> 00:58:59,599
Know that we won't let any of you live.

775
00:59:01,560 --> 00:59:06,119
Don't.

776
00:59:09,560 --> 00:59:12,599
Look.

777
00:59:17,560 --> 00:59:20,119
.We...

778
00:59:21,080 --> 00:59:24,119
..don't want to spill our brothers' blood here.

779
00:59:24,560 --> 00:59:27,119
You know that too.

780
00:59:27,560 --> 00:59:30,119
Come on.

781
00:59:31,560 --> 00:59:34,119
Make way.

782
00:59:42,080 --> 00:59:44,599
Tell me.

783
00:59:44,600 --> 00:59:47,599
Where did they kill Shahzade Ahmet?

784
01:00:22,080 --> 01:00:25,119
The fight happened mostly inside.

785
01:00:25,560 --> 01:00:28,599
No, it wouldn't take this long if it was Alaeddin.

786
01:00:29,560 --> 01:00:31,599
It wouldn't.

787
01:00:31,600 --> 01:00:34,119
But...

788
01:00:35,560 --> 01:00:38,119
Look here.

789
01:00:41,080 --> 01:00:43,599
They killed Ahmet here.

790
01:00:48,080 --> 01:00:50,599
That poor kid died for no reason.

791
01:00:53,560 --> 01:00:58,599
If Alaeddin had done it, he would
have killed Germiyan alps too.

792
01:01:00,080 --> 01:01:02,599
My son did not do it.

793
01:01:06,560 --> 01:01:09,119
Bala.

794
01:01:09,120 --> 01:01:11,599
Osman.

795
01:01:14,560 --> 01:01:17,119
He is our Alaeddin Ali.

796
01:01:17,560 --> 01:01:20,119
He wouldn't do this.

797
01:01:21,080 --> 01:01:23,599
What if...

798
01:01:23,600 --> 01:01:26,119
...it was an accident?

799
01:01:26,560 --> 01:01:29,119
What will we do then?

800
01:01:29,120 --> 01:01:31,599
Justice is blind, Bala.

801
01:01:31,600 --> 01:01:34,119
Allah is the One that gives
also the One that takes.

802
01:01:35,080 --> 01:01:37,599
But...

803
01:01:38,560 --> 01:01:41,119
...Alaeddin wouldn't kill his brother.

804
01:01:41,120 --> 01:01:43,599
If he had done this...

805
01:01:45,560 --> 01:01:48,119
then he will accept the punishment.

806
01:01:51,560 --> 01:01:54,599
Come on.

807
01:02:05,560 --> 01:02:09,119
These are the alps that were
on duty that night, my Bey.

808
01:02:09,560 --> 01:02:11,119
Who else was there that night?

809
01:02:11,120 --> 01:02:14,599
The merchants, and Ibrahim Beys private men.

810
01:02:15,080 --> 01:02:17,119
Not his alps?

811
01:02:17,120 --> 01:02:18,599
Who were they?

812
01:02:18,600 --> 01:02:21,599
A bandit called Ulcay was leading.them.

813
01:02:22,080 --> 01:02:24,599
He uses dual swords.

814
01:02:24,600 --> 01:02:27,119
Dual swords, huh?

815
01:02:30,560 --> 01:02:33,119
That's the jackal that saved konur.

816
01:02:38,560 --> 01:02:39,599
What else?

817
01:02:39,600 --> 01:02:43,599
When they saw that Ahmet Bey was
dead, they went after Alaeddin Bey.

818
01:02:48,560 --> 01:02:50,119
My Bey.

819
01:02:50,120 --> 01:02:52,599
We found Alaeddin Bey's horse outside the market.

820
01:02:52,600 --> 01:02:55,119
They must be running on foot.

821
01:02:57,560 --> 01:02:59,119
Come on, quickly!

822
01:02:59,120 --> 01:03:01,119
We will go there quickly.

823
01:03:01,120 --> 01:03:04,599
We won't rest until we find them, come on.

824
01:03:25,080 --> 01:03:27,599
Ulcay!

825
01:03:35,560 --> 01:03:37,599
Look at him.

826
01:03:37,600 --> 01:03:40,599
Palace Bey is in the forest.

827
01:03:41,560 --> 01:03:45,599
Be careful, or your boots
might get muddy, Mehmet Bey.

828
01:03:46,080 --> 01:03:48,599
I know you are after Alaeddin.

829
01:03:48,600 --> 01:03:51,599
Tell me, where is that pervert!?

830
01:03:52,560 --> 01:03:55,119
They are not far away.

831
01:03:55,560 --> 01:03:58,599
Your sister Gonca is together with Alaeddin.

832
01:03:59,080 --> 01:04:01,599
They were running while holding each other's hands.

833
01:04:05,080 --> 01:04:08,119
I am going to kill Alaeddin, Gonca....

834
01:04:08,560 --> 01:04:11,119
...and that traitor Gulce!

835
01:04:12,560 --> 01:04:15,119
That's what we both want.

836
01:04:16,080 --> 01:04:18,119
Tell me first.

837
01:04:19,080 --> 01:04:21,599
What's the situation of Ibrahim Bey?

838
01:04:21,600 --> 01:04:24,119
Osman keeps my father and Ibrahim Bey prisoner.

839
01:04:27,080 --> 01:04:29,599
You will free them.

840
01:04:30,080 --> 01:04:34,119
Ahmet will be buried in Kayi graveyard tomorrow.

841
01:04:34,560 --> 01:04:38,119
You will attack then and save my father.

842
01:04:38,560 --> 01:04:41,119
That’s what they want.

843
01:04:42,560 --> 01:04:45,119
Consider it done.

844
01:04:45,560 --> 01:04:49,119
But first, we need to get rid of these dogs.

845
01:04:51,560 --> 01:04:54,119
Go that way.

846
01:04:55,560 --> 01:04:58,119
Come on!

847
01:04:58,120 --> 01:05:00,599
Kanyumaz!

848
01:05:07,080 --> 01:05:10,119
Come on Kanyumaz!

849
01:05:18,080 --> 01:05:20,599
If Gonca..

850
01:05:22,080 --> 01:05:28,119
....tell her brother Alaeddin didn't
kill Ahmet, things will fall apart.

851
01:05:29,560 --> 01:05:31,599
Find them before the others.

852
01:05:31,600 --> 01:05:34,119
As you wish Ulcay.

853
01:05:37,120 --> 01:05:39,599
...Hatun speaks...

854
01:05:39,600 --> 01:05:41,599
Mehmet will die.

855
01:05:41,600 --> 01:05:43,599
As you wish Ulcay.

856
01:05:43,600 --> 01:05:47,119
When Yakup Bey hears Beyhood wars will begin.

857
01:05:49,080 --> 01:05:51,599
Ulcaytu Han wants this

858
01:05:52,080 --> 01:05:55,119
Come on! Find them now!

859
01:06:09,080 --> 01:06:11,599
Come on Alps.

860
01:06:45,080 --> 01:06:47,599
They shot Alaeddin.

861
01:06:49,080 --> 01:06:51,119
They went that way.

862
01:06:51,120 --> 01:06:53,599
Come on Osman Bey. Hurry!

863
01:06:54,080 --> 01:06:56,599
Come.

864
01:07:00,080 --> 01:07:02,599
Holofira.

865
01:07:08,080 --> 01:07:10,599
Osman Bey.

866
01:07:10,600 --> 01:07:11,599
My girl.

867
01:07:11,600 --> 01:07:14,119
Alaeddin Bey's in trouble.

868
01:07:16,560 --> 01:07:18,119
Where are they?

869
01:07:18,120 --> 01:07:21,119
They're trapped. They're being chased there.

870
01:07:23,080 --> 01:07:25,119
Don't worry.

871
01:07:25,120 --> 01:07:26,730
We'll make it in time.

872
01:07:26,730 --> 01:07:27,599
Oguz.
-My Bey.

873
01:07:27,600 --> 01:07:29,460
Take Holofira to the tribe.

874
01:07:29,460 --> 01:07:30,380
As you wish my Bey.

875
01:07:30,380 --> 01:07:31,739
Come on my girl.

876
01:07:35,560 --> 01:07:37,119
We don't have time.

877
01:07:37,120 --> 01:07:38,119
Let's go now.

878
01:07:38,120 --> 01:07:40,599
Back on the horses.

879
01:07:54,080 --> 01:07:56,479
Come on.

880
01:08:33,080 --> 01:08:35,599
There.

881
01:08:46,080 --> 01:08:48,599
They're too many.

882
01:08:49,080 --> 01:08:51,599
We can't fight them.

883
01:08:56,080 --> 01:08:57,599
Gonca.

884
01:08:57,600 --> 01:08:59,599
We can't do it if we're together.

885
01:08:59,600 --> 01:09:01,599
What do you mean?

886
01:09:01,600 --> 01:09:03,118
I said what I said Alaeddin.

887
01:09:03,120 --> 01:09:04,118
We'll stick together.

888
01:09:04,120 --> 01:09:06,118
I know Gonca.

889
01:09:06,120 --> 01:09:08,599
But we don't have another choice.

890
01:09:09,080 --> 01:09:11,118
You and Gulce will go to the caves.

891
01:09:11,120 --> 01:09:13,599
Wait there for us.

892
01:09:13,600 --> 01:09:16,118
No. I won't leave you.

893
01:09:16,120 --> 01:09:17,599
We'll come after you.

894
01:09:17,600 --> 01:09:19,599
We won't resist.

895
01:09:19,600 --> 01:09:22,118
We'll take their horses and come for you.

896
01:09:22,560 --> 01:09:26,599
But if you move forward it'll be easier.

897
01:09:30,560 --> 01:09:34,118
Me and Baysungur can fight them off and escape.

898
01:09:34,120 --> 01:09:36,599
Right. Shehzade is right.

899
01:09:37,080 --> 01:09:38,599
If it's less people...

900
01:09:38,600 --> 01:09:40,800
...we'll be able to sneak.

901
01:09:40,800 --> 01:09:42,019
Right?

902
01:09:44,560 --> 01:09:47,118
They’re approaching.

903
01:09:52,560 --> 01:09:54,118
Promise.

904
01:09:54,120 --> 01:09:55,119
You'll come.

905
01:09:55,120 --> 01:09:57,119
I promise. My sweet Gonca.

906
01:09:57,120 --> 01:09:59,119
Don't you worry.

907
01:09:59,120 --> 01:10:01,599
We'll be there before you get there.

908
01:10:01,920 --> 01:10:03,119
I'll wait.

909
01:10:03,120 --> 01:10:05,599
Okay.
Come on.

910
01:10:05,600 --> 01:10:08,119
Gulce

911
01:10:16,560 --> 01:10:18,769
Watch my back.

912
01:10:20,584 --> 01:10:21,584
O Allah!

913
01:10:33,060 --> 01:10:34,439
-Cerkutay!
-My bey

914
01:10:34,439 --> 01:10:35,619
Check the tracks.

915
01:10:42,560 --> 01:10:45,599
Allah, forsake our kids...

916
01:10:45,600 --> 01:10:48,599
Don't worry at all Bala, we're going to find them.

917
01:10:49,560 --> 01:10:52,119
My bey.

918
01:11:04,560 --> 01:11:06,599
The tracks are very confusing.

919
01:11:06,600 --> 01:11:09,119
They lead to everywhere.

920
01:11:09,120 --> 01:11:12,599
I can't understand which way they went to.

921
01:11:15,560 --> 01:11:19,330
Don't worry, we're going to separate too.

922
01:11:19,330 --> 01:11:20,280
-Cerkutay.
-My Bey.

923
01:11:20,280 --> 01:11:23,119
Go that way.
Bala you go this way.

924
01:11:23,120 --> 01:11:25,119
I'll go this way.

925
01:11:25,120 --> 01:11:26,599
We're going to find them, come on.

926
01:11:26,600 --> 01:11:27,599
We will.

927
01:11:27,600 --> 01:11:30,119
-Come on.
-Come on.

928
01:11:42,560 --> 01:11:43,599
Alaeddin.

929
01:11:43,600 --> 01:11:45,599
We should go Gonca Hatun.

930
01:11:45,600 --> 01:11:48,119
Alaeddin Bey can take care of himself.

931
01:11:48,120 --> 01:11:50,119
Alaeddin keeps his promises.

932
01:11:50,120 --> 01:11:52,599
He'll come since he promised he will.

933
01:11:52,600 --> 01:11:54,119
Come on

934
01:11:54,120 --> 01:11:56,599
Gonca.

935
01:11:56,600 --> 01:11:57,599
Don't run.

936
01:11:57,600 --> 01:11:58,119
Run.

937
01:11:58,120 --> 01:12:01,119
Come here. Come here Gonca.

938
01:12:01,120 --> 01:12:03,599
Come here Gonca.

939
01:12:03,600 --> 01:12:06,119
How much longer will you run for?

940
01:12:14,080 --> 01:12:17,599
So you took my sister hostage
to run away from the tribe...

941
01:12:17,600 --> 01:12:19,119
I'm going to end your bloodline.

942
01:12:19,120 --> 01:12:21,119
Get up now.

943
01:12:21,120 --> 01:12:23,599
First Alaeddin.

944
01:12:23,600 --> 01:12:26,599
...then you. I'm
going to kill you both

945
01:12:49,080 --> 01:12:53,119
I would've taken your life
right here right now but...

946
01:12:53,560 --> 01:12:56,119
...you're not worth it Mehmet.

947
01:12:56,120 --> 01:12:58,599
You're not worth it.

948
01:13:15,560 --> 01:13:18,119
He's here...

949
01:13:18,560 --> 01:13:20,289
..but his lover isn't.

950
01:13:20,600 --> 01:13:23,119
Kill them both.

951
01:13:23,120 --> 01:13:25,599
That woman is more important for us.

952
01:13:25,600 --> 01:13:29,599
We have to find her. before Mehmet does. Come.

953
01:13:30,560 --> 01:13:34,599
Shahzade, you should go. I can keep them busy..

954
01:13:34,600 --> 01:13:35,599
No.

955
01:13:35,600 --> 01:13:38,119
We,either die together or live together Baysungur.

956
01:13:55,080 --> 01:13:56,599
Orhan Bey.

957
01:13:56,600 --> 01:13:59,119
There's a fight going on that way.

958
01:13:59,120 --> 01:14:00,599
Alps.

959
01:14:00,600 --> 01:14:02,119
Tie him up.

960
01:14:02,120 --> 01:14:05,119
He's coming with us to the
tribeCome on Elcim Hatun.

961
01:14:37,080 --> 01:14:39,599
Brother.

962
01:14:43,560 --> 01:14:46,119
Do you think you're alone?

963
01:14:46,120 --> 01:14:48,599
Brother..

964
01:15:46,080 --> 01:15:49,599
Come on alps! Leave none alive!

965
01:15:49,600 --> 01:15:52,119
-Mother?
-Son!

966
01:15:53,560 --> 01:15:56,599
I wouldn't leave you to their mercy!

967
01:16:18,080 --> 01:16:21,599
Hold on! We still have lots to do!

968
01:16:25,080 --> 01:16:28,119
-Mother!
-Son, are you okay?

969
01:16:29,080 --> 01:16:30,119
I am okay mother.

970
01:16:30,120 --> 01:16:32,119
-Come on, we are leaving.
-Come on.

971
01:16:32,120 --> 01:16:34,599
Come on.

972
01:16:37,080 --> 01:16:38,419
This way.

973
01:16:42,080 --> 01:16:43,509
Come on!

974
01:16:46,080 --> 01:16:49,119
They found us! Oh Allah, protect Alaeddin.

975
01:16:49,120 --> 01:16:50,599
Where are you running to, woman?

976
01:16:50,600 --> 01:16:54,599
This great forest., can’t hide you from us.

977
01:16:55,080 --> 01:16:58,119
The skies want you to die today.

978
01:16:59,080 --> 01:17:01,599
Capture them!

979
01:17:09,080 --> 01:17:12,599
I will wash in your sacred blood today!

980
01:17:14,080 --> 01:17:16,599
You will die suffering!

981
01:17:17,560 --> 01:17:19,599
Leave Gonca alone!

982
01:17:19,600 --> 01:17:22,119
You jackal!

983
01:17:22,120 --> 01:17:24,599
You are the one that's going to die.

984
01:17:25,560 --> 01:17:28,119
Osman.

985
01:17:28,120 --> 01:17:30,599
Yeah, Osman!

986
01:17:30,600 --> 01:17:33,119
Osman.

987
01:17:33,120 --> 01:17:35,119
Don’t interfere.

988
01:17:35,120 --> 01:17:38,119
I am going to split your face in two now!

989
01:17:38,560 --> 01:17:42,599
May the souls be my witness, I
won't be defeated by you Osman!

990
01:17:58,560 --> 01:18:01,119
I got your whip now!

991
01:18:09,080 --> 01:18:11,599
Come here!

992
01:18:13,560 --> 01:18:15,119
Osman!

993
01:18:15,120 --> 01:18:19,119
You shouldn't have let me taste blood!

994
01:18:19,120 --> 01:18:22,599
Is that so? You will drown in your own blood.

995
01:18:22,600 --> 01:18:26,119
Now tell me about the plan made against my son!

996
01:18:26,560 --> 01:18:28,119
Who is behind it?

997
01:18:28,120 --> 01:18:29,599
Who!?

998
01:18:29,600 --> 01:18:32,119
Who killed Shahzade Ahmet!?

999
01:18:32,120 --> 01:18:33,599
You will tell me all!

1000
01:18:33,600 --> 01:18:37,119
Do you understand? If you want
a quick death, you will tell me all.

1001
01:18:51,560 --> 01:18:54,119
Come here!

1002
01:19:14,560 --> 01:19:17,599
The skies don't want me to die today.

1003
01:19:19,080 --> 01:19:22,599
I will come again.
I will come again!

1004
01:19:38,560 --> 01:19:41,119
My shahzade!

1005
01:19:41,560 --> 01:19:43,599
Don't get close! Stay there!

1006
01:19:43,600 --> 01:19:46,119
Stay back, you dog!

1007
01:19:49,560 --> 01:19:52,119
My shahzade!

1008
01:19:54,560 --> 01:19:56,599
You don't look well, my shahzade.

1009
01:19:56,600 --> 01:19:57,399
Gonca!

1010
01:19:57,600 --> 01:20:00,119
We will find her.

1011
01:20:00,560 --> 01:20:03,119
But not now.

1012
01:20:03,120 --> 01:20:04,599
Come on, my shahzade.

1013
01:20:04,600 --> 01:20:07,119
Come on.

1014
01:20:14,560 --> 01:20:17,119
Gonca.

1015
01:20:17,560 --> 01:20:20,119
I'll find you Gonca.

1016
01:20:21,560 --> 01:20:24,119
Come on.

1017
01:20:29,560 --> 01:20:32,119
Gonca!

1018
01:20:33,560 --> 01:20:35,119
Are you okay?

1019
01:20:35,120 --> 01:20:37,119
I'm okay. But Alaeddin needs help.

1020
01:20:37,120 --> 01:20:38,559
Gonca?

1021
01:20:38,600 --> 01:20:40,119
Alaeddin.

1022
01:20:40,120 --> 01:20:41,119
Are you okay my girl?

1023
01:20:41,120 --> 01:20:43,599
I'm okay Bala Hatun.

1024
01:20:45,080 --> 01:20:47,599
Are you okay?

1025
01:20:48,080 --> 01:20:50,119
Ulcay attacked.

1026
01:20:50,120 --> 01:20:52,599
Osman Bey came right on time.

1027
01:20:52,600 --> 01:20:55,119
What's going on my Bey?

1028
01:20:56,080 --> 01:20:58,119
The jackals eat the lamb.

1029
01:20:58,120 --> 01:21:00,599
And shepherds grieve them.

1030
01:21:00,600 --> 01:21:03,119
But we'll find the jackal.

1031
01:21:03,120 --> 01:21:05,599
We'll find him.

1032
01:21:14,560 --> 01:21:17,119
Osman.

1033
01:21:29,080 --> 01:21:31,479
I will...

1034
01:21:32,080 --> 01:21:34,599
...kill both you and your son.

1035
01:21:40,080 --> 01:21:42,599
Today...

1036
01:21:43,080 --> 01:21:45,599
...I bury my son...

1037
01:21:54,080 --> 01:21:56,599
...but tomorrow...

1038
01:21:58,560 --> 01:22:01,119
...I will take the land I bury him from you.

1039
01:22:03,560 --> 01:22:06,119
It's your fault.

1040
01:22:07,080 --> 01:22:09,599
My son died because of you.

1041
01:22:11,560 --> 01:22:14,119
I told you Ibrahim.

1042
01:22:14,560 --> 01:22:17,599
I said this marriage won't be good for us.

1043
01:22:18,560 --> 01:22:21,119
How could I know Hatun?

1044
01:22:22,080 --> 01:22:24,119
How could I know...

1045
01:22:24,120 --> 01:22:26,599
...Osman would do such an evil thing...

1046
01:22:27,080 --> 01:22:29,119
...and dare to wrong the Turkmen?

1047
01:22:29,120 --> 01:22:31,599
We did the right thing.

1048
01:22:31,600 --> 01:22:34,119
But Osman..
-Osman!

1049
01:22:36,560 --> 01:22:38,119
Osman!

1050
01:22:38,120 --> 01:22:40,599
You keep saying Osman!

1051
01:22:41,560 --> 01:22:43,599
What are you doing Hatun?

1052
01:22:43,600 --> 01:22:45,119
It was a political move.

1053
01:22:45,120 --> 01:22:47,599
Damn your politics.

1054
01:22:49,560 --> 01:22:52,119
Ibrahim.

1055
01:22:52,120 --> 01:22:54,599
Damn your Beylic.

1056
01:22:55,560 --> 01:22:58,119
You're a bad father.

1057
01:22:58,120 --> 01:23:00,119
Melike Hatun!

1058
01:23:00,120 --> 01:23:02,599
Get it together.

1059
01:23:02,600 --> 01:23:04,599
Stop it.

1060
01:23:04,600 --> 01:23:07,119
Don't speak of my beylic.

1061
01:23:07,600 --> 01:23:09,359
My son...

1062
01:23:10,080 --> 01:23:14,119
...died for the future of our beylic.

1063
01:23:15,080 --> 01:23:17,599
Died.

1064
01:23:19,080 --> 01:23:22,119
Look. He's gone.

1065
01:23:22,560 --> 01:23:25,119
Ahmet's gone. He died.

1066
01:23:25,120 --> 01:23:27,599
Look.

1067
01:23:30,080 --> 01:23:32,119
Look at it.

1068
01:23:32,120 --> 01:23:34,599
This cloth..

1069
01:23:35,080 --> 01:23:38,119
...and this cold sword is all that's left.

1070
01:23:39,080 --> 01:23:41,599
Just look.

1071
01:23:47,080 --> 01:23:49,599
Ahmet's sword...

1072
01:23:50,560 --> 01:23:53,119
..is mine now.

1073
01:23:58,080 --> 01:24:00,599
All the blood I shed...

1074
01:24:00,600 --> 01:24:03,119
....will be to avenge him.

1075
01:24:07,080 --> 01:24:09,599
Promise me.

1076
01:24:13,080 --> 01:24:17,119
You will find the murderer who did this to Ahmet...

1077
01:24:17,120 --> 01:24:20,119
...and you won't let him live another day.

1078
01:24:22,080 --> 01:24:24,599
Promise me.

1079
01:24:28,080 --> 01:24:30,599
Hatun, your hand.

1080
01:24:30,600 --> 01:24:33,119
Your hand's bleeding.

1081
01:24:33,120 --> 01:24:34,599
No.

1082
01:24:34,600 --> 01:24:37,119
My heart...

1083
01:24:37,120 --> 01:24:39,599
My heart's bleeding.

1084
01:24:48,080 --> 01:24:50,599
I promise Melike.

1085
01:24:51,560 --> 01:24:54,119
I promise, my Hatun.

1086
01:25:01,560 --> 01:25:04,119
I'll avenge our son.

1087
01:25:07,080 --> 01:25:09,599
Alaeddin...

1088
01:25:10,080 --> 01:25:12,599
I'm not just going to kill them.

1089
01:25:13,080 --> 01:25:16,599
I'm going to do something so
much worse than death to them.

1090
01:25:17,560 --> 01:25:21,599
I'm going to make those who set
that precious heart of yours aflame...

1091
01:25:22,560 --> 01:25:26,599
...live hell on this earth.

1092
01:25:27,080 --> 01:25:29,599
I promise.

1093
01:25:33,080 --> 01:25:35,599
If you...

1094
01:25:35,600 --> 01:25:38,599
you go back on your word... If

1095
01:25:38,600 --> 01:25:41,599
...because of politics...

1096
01:25:43,080 --> 01:25:45,599
...then I won't forgive you.

1097
01:25:46,560 --> 01:25:49,599
I'll take their lifes...

1098
01:25:50,080 --> 01:25:52,599
...and yours.

1099
01:26:03,080 --> 01:26:05,599
Ahmet...

1100
01:26:06,080 --> 01:26:08,599
Son...

1101
01:26:14,080 --> 01:26:18,119
Alaeddin, tell me what happened at the market.

1102
01:26:18,560 --> 01:26:21,119
How did Ahmet die? Did you..

1103
01:26:21,120 --> 01:26:23,119
I am not involved, mother.

1104
01:26:23,120 --> 01:26:26,119
He was alive when we left the tribe.

1105
01:26:27,560 --> 01:26:30,119
So?

1106
01:26:31,560 --> 01:26:35,119
While I was freeing Gonca from the prison tent...

1107
01:26:35,120 --> 01:26:37,599
...Ahmet came in, my bey.

1108
01:26:37,600 --> 01:26:41,119
We fought but I didn't kill him.

1109
01:26:44,080 --> 01:26:46,599
He was knocked out when we left.

1110
01:26:46,600 --> 01:26:51,119
Alaeddin knocked out even
the alps, he didn't hurt anyone.

1111
01:26:51,560 --> 01:26:53,599
Then who killed Ahmet?

1112
01:26:53,600 --> 01:26:56,599
They want the Turks to kill each other.

1113
01:26:56,600 --> 01:27:01,119
The beys have to attack each
other for them to start the war.

1114
01:27:02,080 --> 01:27:06,599
That's why they killed Ahmet and framed you for it.

1115
01:27:07,080 --> 01:27:10,119
Who would want such a bloody war?

1116
01:27:10,120 --> 01:27:13,119
Either Mongols or the infidels.

1117
01:27:13,120 --> 01:27:16,119
Who else wants the Turks to fight?

1118
01:27:16,120 --> 01:27:18,119
What about Ulcay?

1119
01:27:18,120 --> 01:27:19,599
When did he start going after you?

1120
01:27:19,600 --> 01:27:23,119
They cut us off right after we left the tribe.

1121
01:27:24,560 --> 01:27:28,599
That means they followed you. When you left...

1122
01:27:28,600 --> 01:27:31,599
...they went in and killed Ahmet.

1123
01:27:33,560 --> 01:27:36,599
Looks like it's Ulcay who is holding the ropes.

1124
01:27:37,560 --> 01:27:39,119
My bey.

1125
01:27:39,120 --> 01:27:41,599
There is also Boran Bey.

1126
01:27:41,600 --> 01:27:43,119
He was watching our backs.

1127
01:27:43,120 --> 01:27:45,599
Then he retreated.

1128
01:27:47,080 --> 01:27:51,119
Boran is still trying to do things alone.

1129
01:27:52,560 --> 01:27:56,599
He's trying to protect us all by himself.

1130
01:27:58,560 --> 01:28:01,599
My bey, he can't leave you.

1131
01:28:01,600 --> 01:28:04,119
As you know, he has good intentions.

1132
01:28:04,120 --> 01:28:06,599
I know Cerkutay, of course I know.

1133
01:28:07,080 --> 01:28:09,599
But his punishment is decided.

1134
01:28:11,080 --> 01:28:13,599
What will we do now my bey?

1135
01:28:14,080 --> 01:28:15,599
Now

1136
01:28:15,600 --> 01:28:18,119
Everyone is tired right now.

1137
01:28:18,120 --> 01:28:19,599
It's going to get dark.

1138
01:28:19,600 --> 01:28:21,119
We're going to the caves.

1139
01:28:21,120 --> 01:28:23,599
We will spend the night there.

1140
01:28:25,560 --> 01:28:28,119
Why aren't we going to the tribe my bey?

1141
01:28:29,080 --> 01:28:33,599
You shouldn't be seen until the trial.

1142
01:28:34,360 --> 01:28:35,599
Now..

1143
01:28:35,600 --> 01:28:38,599
Yakup Bey and Ibrahim Bey.

1144
01:28:38,600 --> 01:28:42,119
They're quite angry. We
don't know what they might do.

1145
01:28:56,560 --> 01:28:59,119
I have good news.

1146
01:29:00,560 --> 01:29:03,119
Alaeddin Bey.

1147
01:29:03,120 --> 01:29:05,119
Daughter Gonca.

1148
01:29:05,120 --> 01:29:08,599
Tonight is very important for you.

1149
01:29:11,560 --> 01:29:14,119
Mother, what is it?

1150
01:29:14,120 --> 01:29:16,599
It's a good thing.

1151
01:29:19,560 --> 01:29:21,599
Tonight...

1152
01:29:22,560 --> 01:29:25,599
...an Imam will come to the cave.

1153
01:29:27,560 --> 01:29:30,119
You're going to get married.

1154
01:29:37,560 --> 01:29:40,119
What are you saying father?

1155
01:30:05,560 --> 01:30:08,119
Mother.

1156
01:30:09,080 --> 01:30:10,599
My amazing brother.

1157
01:30:10,600 --> 01:30:12,119
Brother.

1158
01:30:12,120 --> 01:30:14,119
You're getting your happy ending after all huh?

1159
01:30:14,120 --> 01:30:16,599
Thank Allah brother, thank Allah.

1160
01:30:25,080 --> 01:30:29,599
First, we need to have a good dinner, huh Beys?

1161
01:30:32,080 --> 01:30:33,599
Hunt somethings.

1162
01:30:33,600 --> 01:30:37,599
Come on, show us your skills.

1163
01:30:40,080 --> 01:30:42,599
Come on.

1164
01:31:39,080 --> 01:31:41,599
This is the place.

1165
01:32:01,560 --> 01:32:04,599
So he placed his camp on this jackal den, huh?

1166
01:32:06,560 --> 01:32:09,599
He is a jackal after all.

1167
01:32:10,080 --> 01:32:12,599
Look.

1168
01:32:12,600 --> 01:32:15,119
That's his Post.

1169
01:32:18,080 --> 01:32:21,119
His Post is there, but he is not here.

1170
01:32:21,560 --> 01:32:24,119
We will wait for him to come.

1171
01:32:24,120 --> 01:32:27,599
We should retreat now before he smells us.

1172
01:32:28,560 --> 01:32:31,119
Come on brother.

1173
01:33:03,560 --> 01:33:06,119
Move!

1174
01:33:57,080 --> 01:33:59,119
You are late.

1175
01:33:59,120 --> 01:34:02,599
Osman saved Alaeddin and
Gonca. Took them somewhere hidden.

1176
01:34:02,600 --> 01:34:05,599
It looks like they knew about it.

1177
01:34:05,600 --> 01:34:09,599
They kidnapped your sister,
when you went to the wedding.

1178
01:34:10,080 --> 01:34:12,599
Alaeddin will pay for this with his life!

1179
01:34:12,600 --> 01:34:17,119
Either him, or me! There is no
other way. I will cleanse this dishonor!

1180
01:34:17,120 --> 01:34:20,599
What are you going to do about
it? Your sister also wanted this.

1181
01:34:21,080 --> 01:34:26,119
My soldiers heard it. Your
sister went with him willingly

1182
01:34:26,560 --> 01:34:30,599
And your sister fought against us with them.

1183
01:34:32,080 --> 01:34:34,599
Gonca will get her punishment too.

1184
01:34:34,600 --> 01:34:36,599
I am going to give her
punishment with my own hands.

1185
01:34:36,600 --> 01:34:41,599
We know very well
about the great Germiyans' power

1186
01:34:42,080 --> 01:34:47,119
Is Kayi going to get away with this, Mehmet Bey?

1187
01:34:47,560 --> 01:34:50,119
Gather your army.

1188
01:34:50,120 --> 01:34:54,119
If this isn't the time to fight, then when is it?

1189
01:34:58,080 --> 01:35:03,119
The army will be ready. This
war will be the end of Kayis.

1190
01:35:03,560 --> 01:35:06,119
But first, we need to save them.

1191
01:35:08,560 --> 01:35:10,599
Don't worry.

1192
01:35:10,600 --> 01:35:13,599
I will save them from Osman.

1193
01:35:14,560 --> 01:35:18,599
You should go and gather your army.

1194
01:35:23,560 --> 01:35:25,599
I heard of you.

1195
01:35:26,560 --> 01:35:28,119
I trust you.

1196
01:35:28,120 --> 01:35:30,119
If it wasn't you I'd be worried.

1197
01:35:30,120 --> 01:35:32,599
You're right.

1198
01:35:33,080 --> 01:35:35,119
When my fathers are safe...

1199
01:35:35,120 --> 01:35:37,599
...the army must be ready.

1200
01:35:38,080 --> 01:35:39,599
Okay.

1201
01:35:39,600 --> 01:35:42,119
Okay, Mehmet Bey.

1202
01:35:42,560 --> 01:35:43,599
Come on.

1203
01:35:43,600 --> 01:35:45,599
Go fast.

1204
01:35:45,600 --> 01:35:48,119
Come on Kayyumaz.

1205
01:35:55,080 --> 01:35:57,119
Little jackals.

1206
01:35:57,120 --> 01:35:59,119
We're going back.

1207
01:35:59,120 --> 01:36:02,119
We'll tell Ilkhanid governor about this.

1208
01:36:02,560 --> 01:36:05,119
Then the great war begins.

1209
01:36:06,560 --> 01:36:09,119
We need Warriros.

1210
01:36:17,080 --> 01:36:19,599
Allah tells us...

1211
01:36:20,560 --> 01:36:23,119
...that evil plans are set soon.

1212
01:36:23,120 --> 01:36:25,599
When it comes...

1213
01:36:25,600 --> 01:36:28,119
those who sit..

1214
01:36:28,560 --> 01:36:31,119
...those who stand...

1215
01:36:31,560 --> 01:36:35,599
..and those who walk will share different fates.

1216
01:36:39,080 --> 01:36:40,599
Peace be with you.

1217
01:36:40,600 --> 01:36:43,119
Peace be upon you.

1218
01:36:47,080 --> 01:36:50,599
Allah speaks of a time as this.

1219
01:36:50,600 --> 01:36:55,119
Do you think it's close?

1220
01:36:58,080 --> 01:37:02,599
Are there ones who betray religion for the world...

1221
01:37:02,600 --> 01:37:07,119
...and lie with no end to gain power...

1222
01:37:08,080 --> 01:37:11,119
...and repeat the process over and over?

1223
01:37:12,560 --> 01:37:16,599
Are there ones who think
awful things about brothers?

1224
01:37:16,600 --> 01:37:19,119
Awful things, Dervish Efendi?

1225
01:37:19,560 --> 01:37:22,119
People kill their brothers.

1226
01:37:23,080 --> 01:37:26,599
If we didn't see it happen...

1227
01:37:27,080 --> 01:37:29,119
..it's called slander.

1228
01:37:29,120 --> 01:37:31,599
Allah forbid.

1229
01:37:31,600 --> 01:37:33,599
Tugay Alp.

1230
01:37:33,600 --> 01:37:35,599
So....

1231
01:37:35,600 --> 01:37:38,119
...we're in that time.

1232
01:37:40,080 --> 01:37:42,599
Evil's a strong presence.

1233
01:37:43,080 --> 01:37:43,879
Then we must go with sunnah.

1234
01:37:43,880 --> 01:37:45,599
Then we must go with sunnah.

1235
01:37:47,080 --> 01:37:49,599
Let me tell you about it.

1236
01:37:50,080 --> 01:37:52,599
To be away from evil...

1237
01:37:52,600 --> 01:37:54,599
the less we move..

1238
01:37:54,600 --> 01:37:56,599
the better we are.

1239
01:37:56,600 --> 01:37:58,599
Muslims can't stay put.

1240
01:37:58,600 --> 01:38:00,119
We move.

1241
01:38:00,120 --> 01:38:01,599
That's what we know Dervish.

1242
01:38:01,600 --> 01:38:04,119
That's why I am confused by your words now.

1243
01:38:08,080 --> 01:38:12,599
Can you see when it's foggy Tugay?

1244
01:38:12,600 --> 01:38:15,599
If you don't see with your eyes...

1245
01:38:16,560 --> 01:38:19,119
.but with the eyes in your heart...

1246
01:38:19,120 --> 01:38:21,599
...don't say it.

1247
01:38:23,600 --> 01:38:26,599
Evil break the eyes in our hearts.

1248
01:38:26,600 --> 01:38:29,599
Who's right or wrong...

1249
01:38:30,560 --> 01:38:34,119
...who's honorable and who's
weak can't be determined.

1250
01:38:36,560 --> 01:38:38,599
If you can't determine it...

1251
01:38:38,600 --> 01:38:41,119
...you must wait.

1252
01:38:41,120 --> 01:38:44,119
You must wait for evil to go..

1253
01:38:45,080 --> 01:38:48,119
...and the fog to be lifted.

1254
01:38:48,120 --> 01:38:51,599
And for the curtains to be lifted from the eyes.

1255
01:38:53,080 --> 01:38:55,119
If not...

1256
01:38:55,120 --> 01:38:57,599
...brothers fight each other...

1257
01:38:58,080 --> 01:39:00,599
...and infidels arise.

1258
01:39:02,560 --> 01:39:05,119
Great Allah says...

1259
01:39:06,080 --> 01:39:07,959
..."Muslims are brothers."

1260
01:39:10,080 --> 01:39:12,599
If Muslim brothers...

1261
01:39:12,600 --> 01:39:15,119
...don’t find those who are traitors...

1262
01:39:15,560 --> 01:39:17,119
...among them...

1263
01:39:18,120 --> 01:39:20,119
...the infidels...

1264
01:39:20,120 --> 01:39:22,599
...will reign with their cruelty.

1265
01:39:22,600 --> 01:39:25,119
That’s why...

1266
01:39:25,120 --> 01:39:26,599
...when the evil comes...

1267
01:39:26,600 --> 01:39:29,119
...we must see who works with the infidels...

1268
01:39:29,560 --> 01:39:32,119
..and who follows evil...

1269
01:39:32,120 --> 01:39:34,599
and betrays the brotherhood...

1270
01:39:35,080 --> 01:39:37,599
..to cause chaos.

1271
01:39:37,600 --> 01:39:39,119
Then...

1272
01:39:39,120 --> 01:39:41,599
...we must stand against it.

1273
01:39:43,080 --> 01:39:46,599
Salvation comes from only this.

1274
01:39:56,080 --> 01:39:58,599
Osman Bey.

1275
01:39:59,080 --> 01:40:01,599
My father and Ibrahim Bey.

1276
01:40:05,080 --> 01:40:08,119
They united with Mekece Tekfur for trade.

1277
01:40:11,560 --> 01:40:14,119
It scares me.

1278
01:40:14,560 --> 01:40:17,119
They're blinded.

1279
01:40:17,560 --> 01:40:19,599
To destroy you...

1280
01:40:19,600 --> 01:40:21,599
...they'll start the war.

1281
01:40:21,600 --> 01:40:23,119
Don't worry my girl.

1282
01:40:23,120 --> 01:40:27,119
You don't need to be scared,
we won't allow this war to happen.

1283
01:40:30,560 --> 01:40:34,599
The fight has started,
with bloodied swords too.

1284
01:40:34,600 --> 01:40:37,599
But the fight of love has been...

1285
01:40:37,600 --> 01:40:40,119
...won by love.

1286
01:40:45,080 --> 01:40:48,599
May our unity be everlasting if Allah permits.

1287
01:40:48,600 --> 01:40:50,119
If Allah permits.

1288
01:40:50,120 --> 01:40:52,599
If Allah permits. mother, if Allah permits.

1289
01:40:52,600 --> 01:40:55,599
Once we get this trail over...

1290
01:40:55,600 --> 01:40:58,119
We're going to have the celebration, right my bey?

1291
01:40:58,120 --> 01:41:02,119
We will.

1292
01:41:05,080 --> 01:41:07,119
We have lots to do.

1293
01:41:07,120 --> 01:41:09,848
If I knew we would
have celebrations like this...

1294
01:41:09,860 --> 01:41:12,599
...one after the other,
I would've prepared myself.

1295
01:41:13,080 --> 01:41:18,599
Don't worry Bala Hatun we will all work
together and get the dowry ready quickly.

1296
01:41:18,600 --> 01:41:22,599
It will be all ready before
Gonca comes to the tribe.

1297
01:41:24,560 --> 01:41:27,119
Come on.

1298
01:41:38,080 --> 01:41:41,119
Everyone is here but me, praise be!

1299
01:41:41,120 --> 01:41:44,119
I was feeling like I was missing something.

1300
01:41:44,120 --> 01:41:46,869
Now that you're here, I’m complete.

1301
01:41:46,890 --> 01:41:48,599
Come, my beautiful daughter.

1302
01:41:48,600 --> 01:41:52,119
We can't do without you daughter, come here.

1303
01:41:53,080 --> 01:41:55,599
I brought the imam brother.

1304
01:41:55,600 --> 01:41:58,599
You see my hard work right?

1305
01:41:58,600 --> 01:42:00,119
I know sister.

1306
01:42:00,120 --> 01:42:03,599
May Allah bless everyone
with a sister as caring as you.

1307
01:42:03,600 --> 01:42:06,119
Ameen.

1308
01:42:11,560 --> 01:42:14,119
Come on.

1309
01:43:01,560 --> 01:43:05,599
Why did you bring this smelly dog into my den?

1310
01:43:08,080 --> 01:43:10,599
For me to strangle?

1311
01:43:11,080 --> 01:43:13,119
We heard about what happened.

1312
01:43:13,120 --> 01:43:17,119
Ibrahim Bey is being kept as a captive by Osman.

1313
01:43:18,080 --> 01:43:22,119
Brother Boran is friends
with Konur, to work with you...

1314
01:43:22,120 --> 01:43:24,599
So...

1315
01:43:25,080 --> 01:43:29,119
...you are the one who was exiled with Konur.

1316
01:43:29,560 --> 01:43:32,119
Boran.

1317
01:43:34,080 --> 01:43:36,599
Where is Konur?

1318
01:43:39,560 --> 01:43:43,159
You saved Konur's life, I heard about it.

1319
01:43:43,560 --> 01:43:46,599
He went to Ibrahim Bey to help.

1320
01:43:46,600 --> 01:43:49,119
I didn't hear from him after that.

1321
01:43:56,560 --> 01:43:59,599
You smell Boran.

1322
01:44:01,560 --> 01:44:03,599
You smell like a skunk.

1323
01:44:03,600 --> 01:44:06,119
But you smell more like...

1324
01:44:06,560 --> 01:44:09,599
...betrayal.

1325
01:44:10,080 --> 01:44:14,599
If I wanted to betray yourself I
would've told your enemy your location.

1326
01:44:18,560 --> 01:44:21,119
If I did...

1327
01:44:21,560 --> 01:44:25,119
...neither you nor your men
would've been alive right now.

1328
01:44:32,560 --> 01:44:35,119
I like you Boran.

1329
01:44:37,080 --> 01:44:39,599
I like you.

1330
01:44:40,080 --> 01:44:43,599
I'm going to give my men that...

1331
01:44:43,600 --> 01:44:45,599
...smelly lands of Osman...

1332
01:44:45,600 --> 01:44:49,119
....his great palaces...

1333
01:44:49,120 --> 01:44:51,599
...and Kayi's red cheeked women.

1334
01:45:01,560 --> 01:45:04,119
You stay silent.

1335
01:45:04,120 --> 01:45:06,599
You don't say anything.

1336
01:45:06,600 --> 01:45:09,599
Are you still feeling...

1337
01:45:09,600 --> 01:45:12,119
...affection towards Osman?

1338
01:45:16,080 --> 01:45:21,119
If Osman finds me he would shred me to pieces.

1339
01:45:21,560 --> 01:45:24,119
Affection.

1340
01:45:24,560 --> 01:45:26,119
What affection?

1341
01:45:26,120 --> 01:45:29,119
I feel sick when hear his name.

1342
01:45:30,080 --> 01:45:34,119
Then I'll tell you what I'll do with Osman.

1343
01:45:36,080 --> 01:45:38,119
I am going to break his cycle!

1344
01:45:38,120 --> 01:45:41,119
I am going to skin him and his family...

1345
01:45:41,560 --> 01:45:44,119
...and make boots out of them!

1346
01:45:44,120 --> 01:45:47,599
I will wash in the blood of the alps!

1347
01:45:51,560 --> 01:45:55,119
You are underestimating Osman.

1348
01:45:56,080 --> 01:45:58,599
Be careful.

1349
01:45:59,080 --> 01:46:01,599
He might...

1350
01:46:01,600 --> 01:46:04,599
...skin you and your dogs...

1351
01:46:05,560 --> 01:46:08,599
...and make a tent out of them!

1352
01:46:18,560 --> 01:46:21,599
Would you like that to happen?

1353
01:46:23,080 --> 01:46:27,119
Or would you like to see Osman kneel before me?

1354
01:46:27,560 --> 01:46:30,119
See his tribes on fire?

1355
01:46:30,120 --> 01:46:34,599
See his women serving me?

1356
01:46:36,560 --> 01:46:39,599
I set on a path together with Konur.

1357
01:46:40,560 --> 01:46:45,119
is what the fate is going to show us.

1358
01:46:47,560 --> 01:46:51,599
And we will live and see it together.

1359
01:46:56,560 --> 01:46:59,119
Only I can determine your fate.

1360
01:47:01,080 --> 01:47:03,599
You will taste...

1361
01:47:04,080 --> 01:47:06,599
...the death from my hands.

1362
01:47:11,080 --> 01:47:13,599
In the name of Allah, the merciful, the beneficent.

1363
01:47:13,600 --> 01:47:16,670
I witness there is no god
other than the one Allah, and

1364
01:47:16,682 --> 01:47:19,599
I bear witness Mohammad
is his servant and messenger.

1365
01:47:23,560 --> 01:47:28,119
Yakup's daughter Gonca Hatun,
do you accept Osman Bey's son...

1366
01:47:28,600 --> 01:47:32,599
...shahzade Alaeddin as your
husband with the mehr of 500 gold coins?

1367
01:47:32,600 --> 01:47:33,599
I do.

1368
01:47:33,600 --> 01:47:36,119
Do you?

1369
01:47:37,600 --> 01:47:38,599
I do.

1370
01:47:38,600 --> 01:47:41,119
Do you?

1371
01:47:41,120 --> 01:47:43,599
I do

1372
01:47:46,080 --> 01:47:48,599
Osman Bey's son Shahzade Alaeddin.

1373
01:47:48,600 --> 01:47:52,119
Do you accept Yakup Bey's daughter Gonca Hatun...

1374
01:47:52,560 --> 01:47:56,599
...as your wife for the mehr of
500 gold coins you promised?

1375
01:48:00,080 --> 01:48:01,599
I do.

1376
01:48:01,600 --> 01:48:03,119
Do you?

1377
01:48:03,120 --> 01:48:04,599
I do.

1378
01:48:04,600 --> 01:48:06,119
Do you?

1379
01:48:11,560 --> 01:48:14,119
Do you witness this?

1380
01:48:14,120 --> 01:48:15,119
We do.

1381
01:48:15,120 --> 01:48:16,119
Do you?

1382
01:48:16,120 --> 01:48:17,119
We do.

1383
01:48:17,120 --> 01:48:18,119
Do you?

1384
01:48:18,120 --> 01:48:18,599
We do.

1385
01:48:18,600 --> 01:48:21,119
May Allah accept it.

1386
01:48:41,080 --> 01:48:43,599
Oh sacred stones, speak!

1387
01:48:43,600 --> 01:48:50,119
Let the sky talk, let the earth listen!
Let this skunk's fate be decided!

1388
01:48:53,080 --> 01:48:55,599
Let blood be spilled!

1389
01:48:55,600 --> 01:48:58,599
The Tengri of the sky show us the way!

1390
01:48:58,600 --> 01:49:03,119
Let this skunk's fate be decided!

1391
01:49:20,560 --> 01:49:23,599
Tengri has spoken.

1392
01:49:48,080 --> 01:49:50,119
Stop, stop.

1393
01:49:50,120 --> 01:49:52,599
Stop!

1394
01:49:52,600 --> 01:49:55,119
Let me tell you what.

1395
01:49:55,120 --> 01:50:00,599
I will wpeak words that you haven't heard before.

1396
01:50:04,080 --> 01:50:06,599
Look.

1397
01:50:08,560 --> 01:50:11,119
Come on.

1398
01:50:24,080 --> 01:50:27,119
I am curious about what a mortal man...

1399
01:50:27,560 --> 01:50:30,599
..so close to death will say.

1400
01:51:17,080 --> 01:51:21,119
Listen Ulcay, I have words for you.

1401
01:51:21,120 --> 01:51:24,599
Why did you even come out in the battlefield?

1402
01:51:24,600 --> 01:51:32,119
Stay away from me don't come close.

1403
01:51:37,560 --> 01:51:42,599
You look like a dog wearing a jackal's fur.

1404
01:51:46,560 --> 01:51:49,119
Look at Osman's old servant.

1405
01:51:50,080 --> 01:51:53,119
He looks pathetic.

1406
01:51:57,560 --> 01:52:01,599
You're a weak man with a bad smell.

1407
01:52:01,600 --> 01:52:05,599
You'll only sleep in the land you wish to own.

1408
01:52:05,600 --> 01:52:13,119
If you wish to kill me now.

1409
01:52:19,080 --> 01:52:25,599
I can kill you right here right now.

1410
01:52:38,080 --> 01:52:40,119
I like you Boran.

1411
01:52:40,120 --> 01:52:42,599
I like you.

1412
01:52:44,080 --> 01:52:46,599
Prepare food for our guests.

1413
01:52:50,560 --> 01:52:53,119
We'll share our last food with them.

1414
01:52:59,560 --> 01:53:02,119
Boran..

1415
01:53:02,560 --> 01:53:04,119
Don't forget.

1416
01:53:04,120 --> 01:53:06,599
Your sword didn't save you.

1417
01:53:07,080 --> 01:53:09,599
Your qopuz did.

1418
01:53:26,560 --> 01:53:29,119
Allah.

1419
01:53:29,560 --> 01:53:32,119
Protect our children and wives.

1420
01:53:32,120 --> 01:53:35,119
Ameen.

1421
01:53:35,120 --> 01:53:38,599
Make us victorious against those who bring us down.

1422
01:53:38,600 --> 01:53:41,119
Ameen.

1423
01:53:52,560 --> 01:53:56,599
Allah bless you.

1424
01:54:03,080 --> 01:54:05,119
My Bey.

1425
01:54:10,080 --> 01:54:11,599
Allah bless you.

1426
01:54:11,600 --> 01:54:13,119
I hope so, my Bey.

1427
01:54:13,120 --> 01:54:15,599
May Allah keep you with us.

1428
01:54:15,600 --> 01:54:16,599
Thank you.

1429
01:54:16,600 --> 01:54:19,119
Mother.

1430
01:54:21,080 --> 01:54:23,599
I hope the best, son.

1431
01:54:23,600 --> 01:54:26,119
I hope so, mother.

1432
01:54:27,560 --> 01:54:30,599
-May Allah bless you.
-Thank you Osman Bey.

1433
01:54:33,080 --> 01:54:35,599
My brother.

1434
01:54:40,080 --> 01:54:42,119
After battles, you finally won at love.

1435
01:54:42,120 --> 01:54:44,599
Because I have a strong brother.

1436
01:54:49,080 --> 01:54:53,599
I know that you keep forgetting me.

1437
01:54:53,600 --> 01:54:56,119
Not without you Fatma.

1438
01:55:01,080 --> 01:55:03,119
Gonca, my girl.

1439
01:55:03,120 --> 01:55:06,119
Don't forget. From now on...

1440
01:55:07,560 --> 01:55:10,119
...you are my daughter too.

1441
01:55:13,560 --> 01:55:15,599
May Allah keep you two together.

1442
01:55:15,600 --> 01:55:17,599
Ameen.

1443
01:55:17,600 --> 01:55:20,119
I know, Bala Hatun.

1444
01:55:20,120 --> 01:55:22,599
Thank you.

1445
01:55:28,560 --> 01:55:30,599
It was a hard time for you.

1446
01:55:30,600 --> 01:55:32,119
I hope you'll stay together easily.

1447
01:55:32,120 --> 01:55:33,599
I hope so.

1448
01:55:33,600 --> 01:55:35,599
Thank you Elcim Hatun.

1449
01:55:35,600 --> 01:55:37,599
Daughter Gonca.

1450
01:55:37,600 --> 01:55:41,119
We had to do it like this now
but once everything's okay...

1451
01:55:41,120 --> 01:55:43,119
...we'll have a nice feast.

1452
01:55:43,120 --> 01:55:44,599
Don't worry okay?

1453
01:55:44,600 --> 01:55:47,119
You're our daughter.

1454
01:55:49,080 --> 01:55:53,599
We're like this because your
father made some mistakes.

1455
01:55:53,600 --> 01:55:58,119
If that wasn't the case we were going to
come and ask for your hand at your tribe.

1456
01:55:58,120 --> 01:56:00,599
I know Osman Bey.

1457
01:56:00,600 --> 01:56:02,599
I wish....

1458
01:56:02,600 --> 01:56:06,119
...my mother and father didn't
fell victim to their greed.

1459
01:56:06,120 --> 01:56:08,599
Wish they were with me.

1460
01:56:10,080 --> 01:56:12,599
But they aren't.

1461
01:56:13,560 --> 01:56:16,119
That's okay.

1462
01:56:16,560 --> 01:56:19,119
I'm sure of both...

1463
01:56:19,560 --> 01:56:22,599
...my path and my companion.

1464
01:56:44,080 --> 01:56:46,069
Feed yourself.

1465
01:56:56,080 --> 01:56:57,599
So?

1466
01:56:57,600 --> 01:57:00,119
Tell us Ulcay.

1467
01:57:00,560 --> 01:57:04,599
Are we going to let Osman keep Ibrahim Bey captive?

1468
01:57:05,560 --> 01:57:08,599
We're going to save them.

1469
01:57:08,600 --> 01:57:11,599
That’s what's keeping this war going.

1470
01:57:22,560 --> 01:57:24,599
Especially...

1471
01:57:24,600 --> 01:57:27,599
...when this finds it's way to likhanids...

1472
01:57:28,080 --> 01:57:30,599
...an army which will come from Konya...

1473
01:57:30,600 --> 01:57:35,119
...will set their great steps
on these foul smelling lands.

1474
01:57:37,080 --> 01:57:41,599
Then, Osman's beyhood will meet it's end.

1475
01:57:42,560 --> 01:57:45,119
Come on.

1476
01:57:45,120 --> 01:57:47,599
It’s time to feed.

1477
01:58:00,080 --> 01:58:02,599
I still can't believe it Alaeddin.

1478
01:58:03,080 --> 01:58:06,119
Our wedding which was held in the sky first...

1479
01:58:06,120 --> 01:58:08,599
...is finally real on earth too.

1480
01:58:08,600 --> 01:58:11,119
We got married.

1481
01:58:11,560 --> 01:58:15,119
We are one.

1482
01:58:18,080 --> 01:58:22,599
No one but death can do us apart now.

1483
01:58:24,080 --> 01:58:26,599
I always said it was going to be hard.

1484
01:58:28,560 --> 01:58:32,119
But even I didn't think it would be this hard.

1485
01:58:34,080 --> 01:58:37,119
My whole past, my mother...

1486
01:58:38,080 --> 01:58:40,599
my father...

1487
01:58:41,560 --> 01:58:44,119
I left them all behind.

1488
01:58:46,080 --> 01:58:48,119
I don’t regret it.

1489
01:58:48,120 --> 01:58:50,599
Don't get me wrong.

1490
01:58:51,080 --> 01:58:54,599
But there is a fire in my heart Alaeddin.

1491
01:58:55,080 --> 01:58:58,119
It burns so much...

1492
01:59:12,560 --> 01:59:14,599
Gonca...

1493
01:59:14,600 --> 01:59:17,599
...the fire in your heart...

1494
01:59:17,600 --> 01:59:20,119
...would turn me into ashes, my wife.

1495
01:59:28,080 --> 01:59:30,599
My wife.

1496
01:59:32,560 --> 01:59:35,119
I'll always be here.

1497
01:59:35,120 --> 01:59:37,599
With you.

1498
01:59:37,600 --> 01:59:41,119
I'll protect you like your father.

1499
01:59:41,560 --> 01:59:44,599
I'll love you with compassion like your mother.

1500
01:59:45,080 --> 01:59:48,119
Don't feel incomplete at all.

1501
01:59:49,080 --> 01:59:51,599
My doe eyed love.

1502
01:59:52,080 --> 01:59:54,599
And I will...

1503
01:59:54,600 --> 01:59:57,119
...love you...

1504
01:59:57,120 --> 02:00:00,119
...as much as my heart and strength allows me to.

1505
02:00:01,560 --> 02:00:05,119
I'll always be with you my husband.

1506
02:00:13,080 --> 02:00:15,599
Gonca...

1507
02:00:20,080 --> 02:00:22,599
My test started in a cave.

1508
02:00:23,080 --> 02:00:26,119
I learned that I'll never have a child ever again.

1509
02:00:26,560 --> 02:00:28,599
But in another cave...

1510
02:00:28,600 --> 02:00:31,119
...gave birth to my child.

1511
02:00:32,080 --> 02:00:34,599
And we held his wedding in another cave.

1512
02:00:37,080 --> 02:00:40,599
Then we will hold their wedding in the cave.

1513
02:00:40,600 --> 02:00:42,599
No, no way.

1514
02:00:42,600 --> 02:00:46,119
I am going to hold a legendary wedding
for my son and my daughter-in-law.

1515
02:00:46,120 --> 02:00:49,599
Okay, mother-in-law Bala. As you say.

1516
02:00:49,600 --> 02:00:53,119
We went through lots of hardships and tests.

1517
02:00:53,120 --> 02:00:55,599
We did not give up.

1518
02:00:55,600 --> 02:00:58,599
And we were blessed with a miracle.

1519
02:00:58,600 --> 02:01:01,119
And our love is still as the same as the first day.

1520
02:01:01,120 --> 02:01:02,599
That's right.

1521
02:01:02,600 --> 02:01:06,119
Those who have a great
love, will also have great tests.

1522
02:01:06,120 --> 02:01:08,599
Well...

1523
02:01:08,600 --> 02:01:11,119
...this hardship is what fuels the fire of love.

1524
02:01:11,120 --> 02:01:15,119
They will go through tests,
and they will be rewarded for it.

1525
02:01:15,120 --> 02:01:17,599
I hope so, Osman.

1526
02:01:18,080 --> 02:01:20,599
They are together now.

1527
02:01:21,560 --> 02:01:24,119
Hopefully they will be safe.

1528
02:01:30,080 --> 02:01:35,119
As long as I am here, no one can harm our children.

1529
02:01:35,560 --> 02:01:38,119
I know Osman.

1530
02:01:38,120 --> 02:01:40,599
But I can't stop being afraid.

1531
02:01:40,600 --> 02:01:42,599
Yakup Bey won't stay put.

1532
02:01:42,600 --> 02:01:45,119
There is a great scheme against Alaeddin.

1533
02:01:45,120 --> 02:01:47,599
They did it before, too, but they failed.

1534
02:01:47,600 --> 02:01:49,119
We defeated them.

1535
02:01:49,120 --> 02:01:50,879
They will lose again.

1536
02:01:51,810 --> 02:01:53,609
I hope so.

1537
02:01:57,560 --> 02:01:59,599
We showed our power to the infidels.

1538
02:01:59,600 --> 02:02:02,599
We paved our path.

1539
02:02:03,080 --> 02:02:07,599
Now we will show them our power
without spilling the blood of our brothers.

1540
02:02:24,560 --> 02:02:26,599
Ahmet!

1541
02:02:27,560 --> 02:02:29,599
My son!

1542
02:02:29,600 --> 02:02:32,599
My lion

1543
02:02:35,560 --> 02:02:38,119
My child!

1544
02:02:38,120 --> 02:02:41,119
You will feel cold under the ground!

1545
02:02:43,560 --> 02:02:45,599
My child.

1546
02:02:45,600 --> 02:02:50,599
I swear those who killed you will be destroyed.

1547
02:02:53,080 --> 02:02:56,599
The flames of hell will
rise and fall into their tent!

1548
02:02:56,840 --> 02:03:00,119
My child.

1549
02:03:30,080 --> 02:03:32,559
My child!

1550
02:05:06,560 --> 02:05:09,599
The herd of sheep got precautions.

1551
02:05:12,080 --> 02:05:15,119
Let my children sharpen their fangs.

1552
02:05:15,560 --> 02:05:19,119
We will tear the flesh from their bones.

1553
02:05:20,080 --> 02:05:24,119
Your land will be destroyed by my children.

1554
02:05:24,560 --> 02:05:27,119
Take one last look.

1555
02:05:27,120 --> 02:05:29,119
You are brave.

1556
02:05:29,120 --> 02:05:32,119
But you can't just hunt by showing them teeth.

1557
02:05:33,080 --> 02:05:36,119
I trained all those alps.

1558
02:05:38,560 --> 02:05:41,599
I guess things will be easier.

1559
02:05:46,560 --> 02:05:49,119
My sons are hungry for blood.

1560
02:05:50,080 --> 02:05:52,119
When the people are gone...

1561
02:05:52,120 --> 02:05:54,599
....we'll attack.

1562
02:06:10,560 --> 02:06:12,599
You go to the tent.

1563
02:06:12,600 --> 02:06:15,119
I will go to Ahmet's grave.

1564
02:06:15,560 --> 02:06:16,599
Alps.

1565
02:06:16,600 --> 02:06:19,119
Don't come with me.

1566
02:06:19,120 --> 02:06:22,599
My Bey. Ibrahim Bey didn't want him buried in Kayi.

1567
02:06:23,560 --> 02:06:26,119
He's buried in Cukurvadi.

1568
02:06:26,560 --> 02:06:29,119
Alright. Come on son.

1569
02:06:29,120 --> 02:06:31,599
Okay my Bey.

1570
02:06:42,080 --> 02:06:44,599
Bala Hatun.

1571
02:06:49,080 --> 02:06:51,599
Are Alaeddin and Gonca okay?

1572
02:06:54,560 --> 02:06:56,599
They’re okay my girl.

1573
02:06:56,600 --> 02:06:58,599
They’re married.

1574
02:06:58,600 --> 02:07:02,119
But they'll hide it until the judge comes.

1575
02:07:02,120 --> 02:07:04,599
Thankfully. I'm so happy.

1576
02:07:04,600 --> 02:07:06,599
That's right.

1577
02:07:06,600 --> 02:07:09,119
At least their tale ended happily

1578
02:07:22,080 --> 02:07:24,599
Well...

1579
02:07:24,600 --> 02:07:26,599
Bala Hatun.

1580
02:07:26,600 --> 02:07:29,119
I know it's not the place...

1581
02:07:29,560 --> 02:07:31,599
...but the ship...

1582
02:07:31,600 --> 02:07:33,119
When will it come?

1583
02:07:33,120 --> 02:07:35,599
I want to go to Constantinople.

1584
02:07:39,080 --> 02:07:40,599
I know my girl.

1585
02:07:40,600 --> 02:07:42,599
I understand

1586
02:07:42,600 --> 02:07:45,599
But it's not the time. There's chaos.

1587
02:07:45,600 --> 02:07:48,119
The roads are dangerous.

1588
02:07:52,560 --> 02:07:55,119
We can secure the roads.

1589
02:07:56,080 --> 02:07:58,599
And send Alps beforehand.

1590
02:08:06,080 --> 02:08:09,599
We must save Alaeddin first.

1591
02:08:09,600 --> 02:08:12,119
We must all deal with it.

1592
02:08:12,560 --> 02:08:15,159
B We can't secure Holofira.

1593
02:08:16,560 --> 02:08:19,119
There are baciyans if no Alps.

1594
02:08:19,120 --> 02:08:21,119
And...

1595
02:08:21,120 --> 02:08:23,599
...I'll help.

1596
02:08:28,560 --> 02:08:30,599
I owe Holofira a lot.

1597
02:08:30,600 --> 02:08:33,119
I want her to get her wish.

1598
02:08:33,560 --> 02:08:35,599
Elcim Hatun.
-Orhan.

1599
02:08:35,600 --> 02:08:37,599
Orhan.

1600
02:08:37,600 --> 02:08:39,119
My girl.

1601
02:08:39,120 --> 02:08:42,119
It's not the time to pay her.

1602
02:08:43,080 --> 02:08:45,599
I know you're kind.

1603
02:08:46,080 --> 02:08:49,599
But I won't put any of you in danger.

1604
02:08:54,560 --> 02:08:57,119
Holofira.

1605
02:08:57,120 --> 02:08:59,599
You should stay longer.

1606
02:09:06,560 --> 02:09:08,599
You're dealing with so much.

1607
02:09:08,600 --> 02:09:11,119
I don't wish to cause trouble.

1608
02:09:11,120 --> 02:09:13,599
I'll do as you wish.

1609
02:09:14,560 --> 02:09:17,119
Thanks.

1610
02:09:26,080 --> 02:09:28,599
Let's go then.

1611
02:09:28,600 --> 02:09:31,119
Come on.

1612
02:09:40,080 --> 02:09:42,599
Come on Elcim Hatun.

1613
02:10:17,240 --> 02:10:19,599
I'm in pain.

1614
02:10:20,560 --> 02:10:25,119
There's a fire in my heart that won't be put out.

1615
02:10:32,080 --> 02:10:34,599
My Ahmet.

1616
02:10:35,080 --> 02:10:40,599
You placed my heart into the
lands of the enemy Ibrahim.

1617
02:10:41,560 --> 02:10:44,599
It's time will come, wife.

1618
02:10:47,560 --> 02:10:51,599
This soil that is embracing our son...

1619
02:10:52,080 --> 02:10:55,119
..will soon be ours.

1620
02:11:14,560 --> 02:11:17,119
Keep your promise.

1621
02:11:18,560 --> 02:11:21,599
Take these lands.

1622
02:11:23,560 --> 02:11:25,599
Ibrahim...

1623
02:11:25,600 --> 02:11:29,119
...they set my heart aflame.

1624
02:11:29,120 --> 02:11:35,119
Rip their hearts out.

1625
02:11:36,080 --> 02:11:38,599
Rip it out...

1626
02:11:45,080 --> 02:11:48,119
I will keep my promise.

1627
02:11:50,560 --> 02:11:53,599
I'm going to do something so much worse...

1628
02:11:55,080 --> 02:11:58,119
...than death to the one who took ours son's...

1629
02:11:59,560 --> 02:12:03,599
...life and set our hearts aflame.

1630
02:12:05,560 --> 02:12:08,119
Ibrahim Bey.

1631
02:12:13,080 --> 02:12:16,119
It's time.

1632
02:12:18,080 --> 02:12:21,119
Be prepared.

1633
02:12:32,560 --> 02:12:36,599
Everyone went away. It's time to hunt.

1634
02:12:37,080 --> 02:12:41,599
We’re going to save the beys and kill the alps.

1635
02:12:41,600 --> 02:12:47,119
The grave will overflow with the blood of the alps.

1636
02:12:48,080 --> 02:12:51,119
Are you ready for the slaughter Boran?

1637
02:12:51,120 --> 02:12:52,599
Always.

1638
02:12:52,600 --> 02:12:55,119
Just take care of your own men.

1639
02:12:55,120 --> 02:12:57,599
We'll see.

1640
02:12:59,080 --> 02:13:01,599
If you hesitate...

1641
