...my sword will appear right on your neck.

1642
02:13:17,560 --> 02:13:19,599
We fulfilled our duty.

1643
02:13:19,600 --> 02:13:21,599
May Allah give his sins.

1644
02:13:21,600 --> 02:13:23,599
Ameen.

1645
02:13:23,600 --> 02:13:26,119
Let's go beys.

1646
02:13:43,560 --> 02:13:46,119
Come on.

1647
02:13:50,560 --> 02:13:54,119
Who do we have here?

1648
02:13:54,120 --> 02:13:57,599
An Osman Bey who is running to his death.

1649
02:13:57,600 --> 02:13:59,599
Be ready.

1650
02:13:59,600 --> 02:14:02,119
Captivity ends here.

1651
02:14:03,560 --> 02:14:06,119
Come on.

1652
02:15:02,080 --> 02:15:04,599
My bey.

1653
02:15:54,560 --> 02:15:58,119
I swear, I won't let...

1654
02:15:58,560 --> 02:16:02,599
...brothers kill brothers in these lands!

1655
